f you do, add this card's effects to that spell.)", "Your life total can't change. (You can't gain or lose life. You can't pay any amount of life except 0.)", '[+1]: Each player discards a card.\\n[−2]: Target player sacrifices a creature.\\n[−6]: Separate all permanents target player controls into two piles. That player sacrifices all permanents in the pile of their choice.', '[+4]: Target player exiles a card from their hand.\\n[−3]: Exile target permanent.\\n[−14]: Restart the game, leaving in exile all non-Aura permanent cards exiled with Karn Liberated. Then put those cards onto the battlefield under your control.', '{1}, Reveal X white cards from your hand, Sacrifice Martyr of Sands: You gain three times X life.', '{1}, Sacrifice a nonland permanent: Magmaw deals 1 damage to any target.', '{1}{G}: Basking Rootwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.\\nMadness {0} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', '{1}{G}: Return target basic land card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{U}, {T}: Create a 2/2 blue Homunculus creature token, then sacrifice a creature.', '{1}{W}, {T}, Discard a card: Create two 1/1 white Citizen creature tokens.', '{2}{B}, Discard two cards: Return Ghoulsteed from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{2}{B}: Return Sanitarium Skeleton from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}{U}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice a land: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "{3}{B}, Exile Ghoulcaller's Accomplice from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Apprentice Necromancer: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature gains haste. At the beginning of the next end step, sacrifice it.', '{G}, Sacrifice Verdant Eidolon: Add three mana of any one color.\\nWhenever you cast a multicolored spell, you may return Verdant Eidolon from your graveyard to your hand.', '{G}, {T}, Discard a creature card: Search your library for a creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{R}, {T}, Discard a card: Create a 3/1 red Elemental creature token named Spark Elemental. It has trample, haste, and "At the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Spark Elemental."', '{T}, Mill a card: Add {C}. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Generator Servant: Add {C}{C}. If that mana is spent on a creature spell, it gains haste until end of turn. (That creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Put a storage counter on Mage-Ring Network.\\n{T}, Remove any number of storage counters from Mage-Ring Network: Add {C} for each storage counter removed this way.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Thespian's Stage becomes a copy of target land, except it has this ability.", "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Add {B}{B}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {G}.\\nPut a -1/-1 counter on Devoted Druid: Untap Devoted Druid.', '{T}: Add {W}.\\nWhen Flagstones of Trokair is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may search your library for a Plains card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {W}.\\n{T}: Return target legendary creature to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Draw two cards, then discard three cards.']
flavor: ['"\'I have arrived,\' bellowed Brawn, and the plane shuddered."\\n—*Scroll of Beginnings*', '"A ruler wears a crown while the rest of us wear hats, but which would you rather have when it\'s raining?"\\n—Barrin, *Principia*', '"All things return to their beginnings. The waters that spill across the Kamitaki Falls flow to sea, only to be returned to her as the rain that joins the mighty river."\\n—Dosan the Falling Leaf', '"Avacyn has abandoned us! We have nothing left except what we can take!"', '"Burn, suffer, and trouble me no more."', '"Children, where are your parents?"\\n—Reig, wandering monk, last words', '"Concentration is key. Without it, a mage conjures nothing but a splitting headache."\\n—Zur the Enchanter', '"Dear brother, it\'s sweet that you have chosen to share your toys with Ludevic, but I too have found some new playmates."\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"Death is tyranny. Like all tyranny, it must be opposed."', '"Death not for survival but for vanity and pleasure? This is the decadence I sought to curb."\\n—Sorin Markov', '"Did you expect me to dodge? How quaint."\\n—Olka, mistmeadow witch', '"Do not mistake your lofty vantage point for safety."\\n—Shaper Tuvasa', '"Either I know just the spell I need, or I\'m about to."', '"Few can coax the creatures within the magma to be cooled and take form."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"From in here, everything looks like dinner."', '"Gambling with mages never is."\\n—Remin, venerable monk', '"Garl, adjust the slurry dispensers. Garl, fetch more corpses. Garl, quit crying and give me your brain tissue. If he doesn\'t stop being so rude, I\'m quitting."', '"I am as the wind that bears me: harsh yet gentle, fleeting yet ever-present. Together we fly beyond imagination."', '"I am the rock of the polis. Death only strengthens me."', '"I feel in them a sense of duty and commitment, yet I can feel nothing else. It is as if their duty is to an empty void."\\n—Razia, Boros archangel', '"I have seen it. Seen the end, seen the beginning, the beginning of the end. Not death, no, no. Transcendence!"', '"I know one night it won\'t come back. Then I\'ll know it\'s truly done its job."\\n—Braenna, cobblesmith', '"I\'ll return once you\'ve ripened."\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"I\'m sure we can come to an arrangement."', '"If Yawgmoth meant Squee\'s immortality as a curse, no one ever told Squee."\\n—Karn', '"If there were such a thing as a soul, I think it would be behind the gallbladder but above the kidneys."', '"If you must go out at night, bring a mob."\\n—Master of the Elgaud Cathars', '"In a war for survival, Dominaria itself became a weapon. The malice is gone, but the danger remains."\\n—Jhoira', '"It was vast, a great sheet of soaring wings, and equally silent. It caught us unawares and blocked our view of the kithkin stronghold."\\n—Grensch, merrow cutthroat', '"Learn from your enemies, but do not tolerate them."', '"Let the deception of the gods yield to the pure light of day."\\n—Brimaz, king of Oreskos', '"Let the flames ignore the sinless."', '"Let the rest of Ravnica sneer. One way or another, they all end up in the undercity."\\n—Jarad', '"Little flower twirl and bloom, arise from this your rocky tomb. Little warrior slash and brawl, be born again to free us all."', '"Living scarecrows make a mockery of the natural order. Dead ones make fine hats."', '"Madness can\'t touch a mind ignited by genius."', '"Mana lurks in all things, even in the depths of one\'s own heart."', '"Molten earth has no anger of its own. Only by infusing it with your own rage can the magma seethe and take shape."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"My \'condition\' is a trial. The weak are consumed by it. The strong transcend it."\\n—Sorin Markov', '"My left has felled a cyclops. My right has slain a giant. I bring both to every fight."', '"Oglor create life, Oglor take it away. Oglor god! ... until Master return."', '"Once in the box, we\'re all the same."', '"Only in our vulnerability is there true power, and that power is life itself."', '"Our archers made sport of it as it fumbled its way up the slag ridge. As it collapsed we thought ourselves safe, but the foul thing carried more than necrogen."\\n—Adaran, Tangle hunter', '"STUFF AND SUNDRIES AND MUNITIONS!"\\n—Breeches, gunner of the *Belligerent*', '"Some trade in goods, some in secrets. My soul has walked the futures, and I offer the rare coin of possibility."', '"The best skaabs are more powerful and more beautiful than the sum of their parts."\\n—Stitcher Geralf', '"The emergence of the Eldrazi isn\'t necessarily a bad thing, as long as you\'ve already lived a fulfilling and complete life without regrets."\\n—Javad Nasrin, Ondu relic hunter', '"The land grows only where the kami will it."\\n—Dosan the Falling Leaf', '"The past is the foundation for all that exists in the present. We merely reconstruct what our ancestors have already discovered."\\n—Sachimir, Sage of Memories', '"The purpose of existence is simple: everything is fuel for the magmaw."\\n—Jaji, magmaw worshipper', '"The seas are vast, but the skies are even more so. Why be content with one kingdom when I can rule them both?"', '"The will of all, by my hand done."', '"There is no greater coward than one who believes in nothing."', '"There is no time to remedy our enemies\' ignorance. Blast it out of them."\\n—Aurelia', '"There\'s nothing to worry about."', '"Think of this new life not as a gift from the angels but as a command to fight for their cause once more."\\n—War blessing of Serra', '"Ulamog is dead, and his brood is dying. Some of them just don\'t know it yet."\\n—Nirthu, lone missionary', '"Unskin these impure bodies, Great Yawgmoth, that the flesh may welcome your blessings."\\n—*Phyrexian Scriptures*', '"We paid the Simic very well for this capability, but we should quickly recoup our expenses in saved wages."\\n—Milana, Orzhov prelate', '"When a phoenix nests in a volcano, we rejoice, for it means a hundred years of war."\\n—Golmak, Keldon warlord', '"While the church thinks in terms of legacies, others think in terms of eternities."', '"Words of power never disappear. They sleep, awaiting those with the will to rouse them."', '"Yawgmoth is dead, and his citadels lie empty. But there will always be some who seek power at any price."\\n—Karn', '"Yawgmoth\'s corpse is a wound in the universe. His foul blood seeps out, infecting the land with his final curse."\\n—Lord Windgrace', '"You cannot achieve greatness if its seed has not already been planted in your heart."', '"You don\'t find many old werewolf hunters."\\n—Paulin, trapper of Somberwald', '"You have done your best. I give you leave to rest."', '"You have not died until I consent."', '"You\'d better be worth it."\\n—Liliana Vess', 'A boon to those who cannot see in the dark. A bane to those who live in it.', 'A capable mage can tune its focus, refracting mana through each disk in turn to cast any spell they desire.', 'A lonely sentinel facing gales, hurricanes, and tides of homicidal spirits.', 'A mage willing to dedicate his life to his craft.', 'A skullkeeper is the first to arrive after the palace archers strike down intruders, probing their brains for choice bits of knowledge.', 'A thousand years removed from her home, her news of war had lost its context, but not its relevance.', "Accept one favor from an ouphe, and you're doomed to accept another.", 'All crave the Blessed Sleep. Few receive it.', 'Amid rumors of war, the third act of *The Absolution of the Guildpact* was quickly rewritten as a tragedy.', 'Among wizards, poor timing is the most consistent mistake.', "An Akroan soldier's worth is measured by the number of swords raised by his battle cry.", 'An avatar he sculpts of anger and flame.', 'Angels watch over mortals with heavy hearts, knowing what fate awaits them in the end.', 'As soon as she faces a monster, she begins composing its epitaph.', 'As the Simic released more of their krasis experiments, they required new habitats, always at the expense of the locals.', 'Beware the generosity of demons.', 'Bred for battle in the Grand Coliseum, these wurms annihilated whole ecosystems when released into the wild.', 'Countless delights drift on the surface while dark schemes run below.', 'Displays of Voldaren bloodlust are not restricted to glamorous banquets and lavish parties.', "Doing something at the last minute isn't so bad when you can make that minute last.", 'Driven by an insatiable hunger, gremlins never cease feeding. They can destroy a lifetime of work in just a few moments.', 'During the collision of the shards, entire ways of life disappeared without a trace.', 'Dust-spiked winds eroded the stones, but the ground where they had stood still holds power.', 'Each of the twenty-three winds of Esper is named and chronicled, and every possible interaction with the flow of magic is exhaustively detailed.', 'Elementals are ideas given form. This one is the idea of "smashitude."', 'Every action has a foreseen purpose.', 'For a ghoul, every village is a buffet and every disaster is a reunion.', 'Goblins in the first wave of a fire raid always bemoan the aim of everyone else.', 'Great devotion yields great reward.', "He's mastered the art of sleight of land.", 'His mind was lost long before his flesh.', 'His mind whirled with grand plans, never thinking of what might happen if he were to succeed.', 'His soldiers etch his words on the insides of their shields, their inspiration always in sight during battle.', 'Honor the gods of Theros, and they will return the favor.', "If at first you don't succeed, hit them again.", 'If everything in the Gurmag Swamp hungers for human flesh, what bait could be more effective?', 'If it comes for you, die boldly or die swiftly—for die you will.', 'Immolation is the sincerest form of flattery.', "In Lorwyn's brief evenings, the sun pauses at the horizon long enough for a certain species of violet to bloom with the fragrance of mischief.", 'Infinite potential given finite form.', 'Instead of creating a tool that would be damaged by heat, the Thran built one that was charged by it.', 'Interlopers in Sultai territory usually end up as crocodile chow or baboon bait.', 'It ignores such insignificant forces as time, entropy, and death.', 'It once served a cathar roadwatcher, patrolling the crossways between villages. Its hooves still carry it along the same path.', 'It teaches *you* to play dead.', 'It took the banning of temporal manipulation at Tolaria West to teach its students the value of time.', "It's not any fun until someone loses an eye.", "It's not the most subtle incantation, but it gets the point across.", "It's pretty cute—from a distance.", "It's sent into unguilded districts by the Orzhov to collect the souls of those no one will miss.", 'Its ferocity cannot be contained in one lifetime.', 'Just as with a peach, the first bite is always the juiciest.', 'Leave but a shred of root and it will return, bursting with vigor.', 'Life is eternal. A lifetime is ephemeral.', 'Liliana viewed the attention of the angels as a testament to her power. Even so, they were an annoyance.', 'Not even death will keep her from her mission.', 'Not wind, but the breath of the dead.', "Nothing impresses goblins more than something that's bound to kill them.", 'Of royal blood among the spirits of the air, the Mahamoti djinn rides on the wings of the winds. As dangerous in the gambling hall as he is in battle, he is a master of trickery and misdirection.', "Ogle the bogle, or goggle the boggle? Doesn't matter. You weren't going to catch it anyway.", 'On every plane in the Multiverse, there is magic, and someone is using it to fly.', 'Once the hideous disease takes hold, it spreads through both bark and mind.', "One wizard's trash is another wizard's roving gang of abominations.", 'Otto the Hunter was filled with many grand ambitions. The snake was filled only with Otto.', 'Pray her spear reaches you first. Her griffin is less kind.', "Ral Zarek's brainstorms bring actual thunder and lightning.", 'Rumors quickly spread among thieves about a labyrinth without walls and a prize beyond all measures of worth.', 'She protects the sacred groves from blight, drought, and the Unbeholden.', "She remembers every word spoken, from the hero's oath to the baby's cry.", 'She wears the talismans of every creature she can evoke.', 'Shiny polished silver can ward off many creatures, but it attracts others.', 'So great are his wisdom and spirit that many who have met him say that they stood before a giant of a man and talked to the wisest of the four winds.', 'So long as death follows life, the supply lines of the Sultai will never be cut.', 'Some protection requires a bit of finesse.', 'Take two steps north into the unsettled future, south into the unquiet past, east into the present day, or west into the great unknown.', "Takedowns in Valor's Reach are never meant to be lethal, but that doesn't mean they won't be incredibly painful.", 'Takenuma was filled with a chorus of moans, shrieks, and wails. Some came from the living, some from the dying, and some, most horribly, from the dead.', 'The Flowing Staff technique does not differentiate between offense and defense.', 'The Iroan Games award no medals. Athletes vie for a visit from Iroas, god of victory.', 'The Krark Clan enjoys pulling them apart just to watch them reassemble one another.', 'The aberrant magic of the Rimewind drew the unicorns back from the northern wastes to do battle once again.', 'The barest taste of Eldrazi power shatters both realms and identities.', 'The blessings of Heliod are apparent for all to see.', 'The currents of the Marang wash away both tracks and blood.', 'The first satyr to wake after a revel must search for the site of the next one.', 'The forlorn cries of the dead combine to make its laugh.', 'The foyer is littered with the coins it demands but can no longer hold.', 'The juiciest prey is that which grows lazy, thinking itself beyond the reach of danger.', 'The lives of elves are long, but their memories are longer. Even after death, they do not desert their homes.', 'The most beautiful souls shine even in death.', 'The only thing it likes more than discovering a pit of bones is adding to it.', 'The scrape of shovels and the tumble of cold dirt soon muffled their pleas.', 'The sigil represents an honor that endures beyond death.', 'The view from above is an inspiration to the newly winged.', 'There is no glory to be gained in the kingdom of the dead.\\n—Vec tomb inscription', 'To prepare for the Trial of Strength, nagas shed their old skin—and with it their scars, their doubts, and their fears.', 'Trust is the only bridle a pegasus will accept.', 'Visiting a shrine at the start of a journey makes the traveler more likely to finish it.', "What doesn't grow, dies. And what dies grows the tarmogoyf.", "When demons open a path to your front door, it's time to move."]
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brian Hagan', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Dorman', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Palumbo', 'David Rapoza', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Donato Giancola', 'Drew Baker', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Even Amundsen', 'Eytan Zana', 'Filip Burburan', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Staples', 'Heather Hudson', 'Howard Lyon', 'Iain McCaig', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jakub Kasper', 'James Paick', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Kang', 'Jeff Simpson', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Matson', 'John Stanko', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kimonas Theodossiou', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Livia Prima', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael C. Hayes', 'Michael Komarck', 'Michael Phillippi', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mitchell Malloy', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Pete Venters', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robbie Trevino', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Sung Choi', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Tianhua X', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'YW Tang', 'Yefim Kligerman', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yigit Koroglu', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
