rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Searching for a creature card is optional.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple “extra turn” effects resolve in the same turn, take them in the reverse of the order that the effects resolved.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability is never a mana ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-25\', \'text\': "You get the mana whether you want it or not. If you don\'t spend it, it will disappear at the end of the current step (or phase)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The timestamp for the "in your graveyard" ability is set at the time that this card goes to your graveyard, regardless of whether you control a Mountain at that time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'This card is put directly into your hand. It is not drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "You don\'t reveal the card to your opponent."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'You pick a card on resolution.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can look in your library and then choose to find any number from zero to three creatures after you look at it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'Disrupting Shoal can target any spell, but does nothing unless that spell’s converted mana cost is X.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a card in your hand has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the converted mana cost of that spell, even if it was cast for an alternative cost and no mana was spent on X.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'The -1/-1 counters stay even if the Aura is removed, and the +3/+3 goes away when the Aura does.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'The first ability triggers when Golgari Brownscale returns to your hand from your graveyard for any reason, not just when you use its dredge ability.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Dredge lets you replace any card draw, not just the one during your draw step.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Once you decide to replace a draw using a card’s dredge ability, that card can’t be removed from your graveyard “in response.” (Replacement effects don’t use the stack.)'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You can’t use dredge unless you’re going to draw a card and the card with dredge is already in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-02-01', 'text': 'If this card’s ability is activated by one player, then another player takes control of it on the same turn, the second player can’t activate its ability that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'A card that’s already revealed for another cost or because of an effect can be revealed to pay this cost.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'Each card that’s revealed to pay the cost remains revealed until the ability leaves the stack.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'If one of the cards that’s revealed to pay the cost leaves its owner’s hand before the ability resolves, it stops being revealed, but the value of X is not affected.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "If all other Auras attached to the enchanted creature stop enchanting it, Daybreak Coronet will be attached to an illegal permanent and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If multiple Auras are entering the battlefield at the same time, you choose which player or permanent each enchants before any of them enter the battlefield. This means that Daybreak Coronet can\'t be put onto the battlefield enchanting a creature that\'s not enchanted before the Auras all enter the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A card with a splice ability can’t be spliced onto itself because the spell is on the stack (and not in your hand) when you reveal the cards you want to splice onto it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You choose all targets for the spell after revealing cards you want to splice, including any targets required by the text of any of those cards. You may choose a different target for each instance of the word “target” on the resulting spell.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If one half of a split card has a converted mana cost of 3 or less and doesn’t have an {X} in its mana cost, Gaddock Teeg lets you cast that half.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A spell’s converted mana cost is determined only by its mana cost. Alternative costs (including casting a spell “without paying its mana cost”), additional costs, and cost reductions don’t affect a spell’s converted mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less to cast a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its evoke cost, too. That’s because they affect the total cost of the spell, not its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Evoke doesn’t change the timing of when you can cast the creature that has it. If you could cast that creature spell only when you could cast a sorcery, the same is true for cast it with evoke.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a creature spell cast with evoke changes controllers before it enters the battlefield, it will still be sacrificed when it enters the battlefield. Similarly, if a creature cast with evoke changes controllers after it enters the battlefield but before its sacrifice ability resolves, it will still be sacrificed. In both cases, the controller of the creature at the time it left the battlefield will control its leaves-the-battlefield ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t use its evoke ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'When you cast a spell by paying its evoke cost, its mana cost doesn’t change. You just pay the evoke cost instead.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Whether evoke’s sacrifice ability triggers when the creature enters the battlefield depends on whether the spell’s controller chose to pay the evoke cost, not whether they actually paid it (if it was reduced or otherwise altered by another ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Reveillark’s ability may target zero, one, or two creature cards in your graveyard. Each target must have power 2 or less.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less to cast a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its evoke cost, too. That’s because they affect the total cost of the spell, not its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Evoke doesn’t change the timing of when you can cast the creature that has it. If you could cast that creature spell only when you could cast a sorcery, the same is true for cast it with evoke.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a creature spell cast with evoke changes controllers before it enters the battlefield, it will still be sacrificed when it enters the battlefield. Similarly, if a creature cast with evoke changes controllers after it enters the battlefield but before its sacrifice ability resolves, it will still be sacrificed. In both cases, the controller of the creature at the time it left the battlefield will control its leaves-the-battlefield ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t use its evoke ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'When you cast a spell by paying its evoke cost, its mana cost doesn’t change. You just pay the evoke cost instead.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Whether evoke’s sacrifice ability triggers when the creature enters the battlefield depends on whether the spell’s controller chose to pay the evoke cost, not whether they actually paid it (if it was reduced or otherwise altered by another ability, for example).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The effect is mandatory. You’ll lose 1 life even if you have only 1 life left.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The life loss isn’t a payment. You’ll get a token even if you had 0 life (and another effect is stopping you from losing the game).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Murderous Redcap’s power is checked at the time the ability resolves. If it’s left the battlefield by then, its last known information is used.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'The controller of Beckon Apparition gets the token.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Beckon Apparition will be on the stack when you choose its target. It can’t target itself.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target card becomes an illegal target for Beckon Apparition, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t create a token.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'Any Aura card you find with Sovereigns of Lost Alara’s second ability must be able to enchant the attacking creature as it currently exists. You need to check the Aura’s enchant ability as well as any effects, such as protection, that would make it illegal to attach that Aura to the attacking creature. For example, if the attacking creature were an artifact creature with protection from blue, you could find an Aura with “enchant artifact,” but you could not find a blue Aura.'}, {'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'If the attacking creature has left the battlefield by the time Sovereigns of Lost Alara’s second ability resolves, you can’t put an Aura onto the battlefield this way. You may still choose to search your library just to shuffle it.'}, {'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'If you choose to search your library but no applicable Aura card is left in your deck (or you choose not to find one), then nothing enters the battlefield and you simply shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'The attacking creature is not targeted by either this ability or the Aura, so a creature with shroud can be enchanted this way.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you choose to search your library but no applicable Aura card is left in your library (or you choose not to find one), then nothing enters the battlefield and you simply shuffle your library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "A land that becomes a creature may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Any +1/+1 counters put on Raging Ravine remain on it even after it stops being a creature. They\'ll have no effect until it becomes a creature again."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Each time you activate Raging Ravine\'s last ability, it gains an instance of the triggered ability. For example, if you activate the last ability twice and then attack with Raging Ravine, both of the triggered abilities it gained will trigger. It will get a total of two +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'A land that becomes a creature may be affected by "summoning sickness." You can\\\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If Celestial Colonnade can\'t attack unless you pay a cost that includes a mana payment, you may attack with it and tap it to pay for that cost. It will still attack in this case."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Once Celestial Colonnade has attacked, tapping it for mana won\'t remove it from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'A land that becomes a creature may be affected by "summoning sickness." You can\\\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'A land that becomes a creature may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can’t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'When a land becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won\'t be able to block."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn\'t blocked, it simply won\'t deal combat damage to anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Snake Umbra grants the triggered ability to the creature. It triggers whenever the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent of its controller (who is not necessarily an opponent of the Aura\'s controller). In other words, if your Snake Umbra winds up enchanting your opponent\'s creature, that opponent will draw a card whenever that creature damages you."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'The ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals any damage, not just combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability says that it would "destroy" a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\\\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\\\'s sacrificed, if the "legend rule" applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Totem armor\\\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\\\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\\\'s being affected by an effect that says to "destroy" it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'A colored permanent is a permanent with at least one colored mana symbol in its mana cost. Note that effects may cause a colored permanent to become colorless (as Moonlace could), or a colorless permanent to become colored (as Crimson Wisps could).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'All the colored permanents are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Lands have no mana cost, so they are colorless unless an effect states otherwise.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Tokens may also be colored permanents. The effect that creates a token states what color it is or whether it’s colorless.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'All Is Dust doesn’t destroy permanents. Rather, it causes them to be sacrificed. Regeneration, totem armor, and indestructible can’t save permanents from All Is Dust.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A land card that produces colored mana, even a land with a basic land type, normally has no color.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Eldrazi Conscription is an Eldrazi. However, it doesn’t turn the enchanted creature into an Eldrazi.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a creature has multiple instances of annihilator, each triggers separately when that creature attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary creature with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Ulamog’s ability triggers as you cast it, and that ability resolves before the spell itself. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Emrakul can be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Countersquall). Those spells will resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Emrakul won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Emrakul can’t be the target of colored Aura spells, but colored Auras can be put onto the battlefield enchanting it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Emrakul’s second ability triggers as you cast it, and that ability resolves before the spell itself. It resolves even if that spell is somehow removed from the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': '“Colored spells” is not synonymous with “colored cards.” For example, even though creatures are spells when they’re cast, they’re not spells when they’re on the battlefield and can block Emrakul; and triggered abilities of permanents entering the battlefield (such as that of Banishing Light) can target it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Ulamog’s Crusher can’t attack for any reason (such as becoming tapped or having just entered the battlefield), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Annihilator abilities trigger and resolve during the declare attackers step. The defending player chooses and sacrifices the required number of permanents before they declare blockers. Any creatures sacrificed this way won’t be able to block.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature with annihilator is attacking a planeswalker, and the defending player chooses to sacrifice that planeswalker, the attacking creature continues to attack. It may be blocked. If it isn’t blocked, it simply won’t deal combat damage to anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Kozilek’s first ability triggers as you cast it, and that ability resolves before the spell itself. It resolves even if the spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time the totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Planar Cleansing) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. (This matters for cards such as Karmic Justice.) Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and the enchanted permanent has gained a regeneration shield. The next time it would be destroyed, you choose whether to apply the regeneration effect or the totem armor effect. The other effect is unused and remains, in case the permanent would be destroyed again.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Doom Blade). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Vendetta does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Say you control a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, and that Aura has gained a regeneration shield. The next time the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, the Aura would be destroyed instead — but it regenerates, so nothing is destroyed at all. Alternately, if that Aura somehow gains indestructible, the enchanted permanent is effectively indestructible as well.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary permanent with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Mystic Retrieval can’t target itself. It’s on the stack when you choose its target.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than four cards in your library, you\'ll look at all the cards there and put one into your hand and the rest into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The number of creature cards in your graveyard is counted when Spider Spawning resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You choose the target creature with flying when the ability goes on the stack. When it resolves, you choose whether or not to destroy the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Discarding a card is part of the ability’s activation cost. You can’t activate the ability if you have no cards in hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If a player chooses to have Vexing Devil deal 4 damage to them, but some or all of that damage is prevented or redirected, Vexing Devil will still be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'As Vexing Devil’s ability resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses whether to be dealt 4 damage, then each other opponent in turn order does the same. If any of them do, you sacrifice Vexing Devil.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'No player may take actions between the time an opponent chooses to be dealt damage by Vexing Devil and the time you sacrifice Vexing Devil. This means that you can’t use a spell or ability (such as Turn to Mist) to stop Vexing Devil from being sacrificed if a player chooses to be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, count the number of instances of exalted among permanents you control. After those abilities resolve, that’s how many times the creature will get +1/+1.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "This is not the same as hexproof. If, for example, you target one of your opponent\'s creatures, your opponents won\'t be able to target their own creature with spells or abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Shielding Plax tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this card for its evoke cost, you may put the sacrifice trigger and the regular enters-the-battlefield trigger on the stack in either order. The one put on the stack last will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Aethersnipe can be the target of its own ability. If it’s the only nonland permanent on the battlefield, it must be the target of its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this card for its evoke cost, you may put the sacrifice trigger and the regular enters-the-battlefield trigger on the stack in either order. The one put on the stack last will resolve first.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to otherwise remove the creature card you exiled in order to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must exile exactly one creature card from your graveyard to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without exiling a creature card, and you cannot exile additional creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A card with a splice ability can’t be spliced onto itself because the spell is on the stack (and not in your hand) when you reveal the cards you want to splice onto it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Desperate Ritual isn’t a mana ability. When cast, it (or the spell it’s spliced onto) goes on the stack like any spell and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You choose all targets for the spell after revealing cards you want to splice, including any targets required by the text of any of those cards. You may choose a different target for each instance of the word “target” on the resulting spell.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A card with a splice ability can’t be spliced onto itself because the spell is on the stack (and not in your hand) when you reveal the cards you want to splice onto it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You choose all targets for the spell after revealing cards you want to splice, including any targets required by the text of any of those cards. You may choose a different target for each instance of the word “target” on the resulting spell.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the returned creature leaves the battlefield before the end step, it will remain in its current zone. It won’t be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Dredge lets you replace any card draw, not just the one during your draw step.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Once you decide to replace a draw using a card’s dredge ability, that card can’t be removed from your graveyard “in response.” (Replacement effects don’t use the stack.)'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You can’t use dredge unless you’re going to draw a card and the card with dredge is already in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Golgari Grave-Troll may become lethal if you return remove +1/+1 counters from it during that turn. In this case, it dies before you can resolve the activated ability that will regenerate it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you return Golgari Grave-Troll from your graveyard directly to the battlefield, its first ability counts itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Dredge lets you replace any card draw, not just the one during your draw step.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Once you decide to replace a draw using a card’s dredge ability, that card can’t be removed from your graveyard “in response.” (Replacement effects don’t use the stack.)'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You can’t use dredge unless you’re going to draw a card and the card with dredge is already in your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner\'s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won\'t trigger and the card won\'t return to the battlefield. That\'s because persist checks the creature\'s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they\'ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player\'s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player\'s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it\'s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence."}]', "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You choose the color as Gods Willing resolves. Once the color is chosen, it\'s too late for players to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Gods Willing tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t scry 1. If the target creature becomes an illegal target while Gods Willing is resolving (most likely because you gave it protection from white), you do scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'You can\\\'t choose "artifact" or "colorless" as Gods Willing asks you to choose a color because those are not colors.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Resolving Arena Athlete\'s ability after a creature has blocked won\'t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause the creature it blocked to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}]', "[{'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Heroic abilities won’t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell’s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Hero of Iroas’s first ability will apply if you cast a card for its bestow cost.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Hero of Iroas’s first ability reduces only generic mana in the spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Heroic abilities won’t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell’s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The amount to pay for {X} is chosen as the triggered ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you pay {X} and the time Hero of Leina Tower has X +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Enchantment creatures with bestow from the Theros block aren’t Aura cards in your library. You can’t find one with Heliod’s Pilgrim.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost. For example, Dead Drop’s converted mana cost is 10 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The rules for delve have changed slightly since it was last in an expansion. Previously, delve reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under the current rules, you exile cards from your graveyard at the same time you pay the spell’s cost. Exiling a card this way is simply another way to pay that cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile cards to pay for the colored mana requirements of a spell with delve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than nine cards from your graveyard to cast Dead Drop.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Prowess triggers only once for any spell, even if that spell has multiple types.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-01-19', 'text': 'Tasigur, the Golden Fang is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Tasigur’s last ability doesn’t target any card or player. You choose an opponent as the ability resolves and that player chooses a nonland card after you put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The chosen opponent can choose any nonland card in your graveyard, not just one of the cards that was just put there.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise’s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Tasigur’s last ability doesn’t target any card or player. You choose an opponent and that player chooses a nonland card only after you mill two cards.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The chosen opponent can choose any nonland card in your graveyard, not just one of the milled cards.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'You draw a card as Dark Dabbling resolves, not as the creature actually regenerates.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Dark Dabbling is still on the stack while you count the number of instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard. It doesn’t count itself.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Dark Dabbling’s spell mastery ability is a normal spell effect, not a replacement effect. This means that if you replace drawing a card for Dark Dabbling’s effect with dredging a card from your graveyard, the cards put into your graveyard this way may enable the additional regeneration.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Dark Dabbling tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card and no creatures are regenerated.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast Swift Reckoning from your graveyard, you need two other instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard to cast it as though it had flash.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The number of instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard matters only as you begin to cast Swift Reckoning. Once it’s cast, that number doesn’t matter and will have no effect on Swift Reckoning resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'A spell cast for its madness cost is put onto the stack like any other spell. It can be countered, copied, and so on. As it resolves, it’s put onto the battlefield if it’s a permanent card or into its owner’s graveyard if it’s an instant or sorcery card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Cards are discarded in a Magic game only from a player’s hand. Effects that put cards from a player’s library into that player’s graveyard do not cause those cards to be discarded.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Casting a spell for its madness cost doesn’t change its mana cost or its converted mana cost. You just pay the madness cost instead.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less for its madness cost, too.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you choose not to cast a card with madness when the madness triggered ability resolves, it’s put into your graveyard. You don’t get another chance to cast it later.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness to pay the cost of a spell or activated ability, that card’s madness trigger (and the spell that card becomes, if you choose to cast it) will resolve before the spell or ability the discard paid for.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness while resolving a spell or ability, it moves immediately to exile. Continue resolving that spell or ability—the card is not in your graveyard at this time. Its madness trigger will be placed onto the stack once that spell or ability has completely resolved.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Madness works independently of why you’re discarding the card. You could discard it to pay a cost, because a spell or ability tells you to, or even because you have too many cards in your hand at the end of your turn. You can’t discard a card with madness just because you want to, though.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'When you cast a card with madness, it was still discarded. If it was discarded to pay a cost, that cost is still paid. Abilities that trigger when a card is discarded will still trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it, even though those remain attached to it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Malevolent Whispers can target any creature, even one that’s untapped or one you already control.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'A spell cast for its madness cost is put onto the stack like any other spell. It can be countered, copied, and so on. As it resolves, it’s put onto the battlefield if it’s a permanent card or into its owner’s graveyard if it’s an instant or sorcery card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Cards are discarded in a Magic game only from a player’s hand. Effects that put cards from a player’s library into that player’s graveyard do not cause those cards to be discarded.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Casting a spell for its madness cost doesn’t change its mana cost or its converted mana cost. You just pay the madness cost instead.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less for its madness cost, too.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you choose not to cast a card with madness when the madness triggered ability resolves, it’s put into your graveyard. You don’t get another chance to cast it later.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness to pay the cost of a spell or activated ability, that card’s madness trigger (and the spell that card becomes, if you choose to cast it) will resolve before the spell or ability the discard paid for.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness while resolving a spell or ability, it moves immediately to exile. Continue resolving that spell or ability—the card is not in your graveyard at this time. Its madness trigger will be placed onto the stack once that spell or ability has completely resolved.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Madness works independently of why you’re discarding the card. You could discard it to pay a cost, because a spell or ability tells you to, or even because you have too many cards in your hand at the end of your turn. You can’t discard a card with madness just because you want to, though.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'When you cast a card with madness, it was still discarded. If it was discarded to pay a cost, that cost is still paid. Abilities that trigger when a card is discarded will still trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'A spell cast for its madness cost is put onto the stack like any other spell. It can be countered, copied, and so on. As it resolves, it’s put onto the battlefield if it’s a permanent card or into its owner’s graveyard if it’s an instant or sorcery card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Cards are discarded in a Magic game only from a player’s hand. Effects that put cards from a player’s library into that player’s graveyard do not cause those cards to be discarded.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Casting a spell for its madness cost doesn’t change its mana cost or its mana value. You just pay the madness cost instead.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less for its madness cost, too.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you choose not to cast a card with madness when the madness triggered ability resolves, it’s put into your graveyard. You don’t get another chance to cast it later.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness to pay the cost of a spell or activated ability, that card’s madness trigger (and the spell that card becomes, if you choose to cast it) will resolve before the spell or ability the discard paid for.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness while resolving a spell or ability, it moves immediately to exile. Continue resolving that spell or ability—the card is not in your graveyard at this time. Its madness trigger will be placed onto the stack once that spell or ability has completely resolved.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Madness works independently of why you’re discarding the card. You could discard it to pay a cost, because a spell or ability tells you to, or even because you have too many cards in your hand at the end of your turn. You can’t discard a card with madness just because you want to, though.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'When you cast a card with madness, it was still discarded. If it was discarded to pay a cost, that cost is still paid. Abilities that trigger when a card is discarded will still trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when Rally the Peasants resolves will be affected. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn will not.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'For split cards, the flashback cost you pay is determined by the half you cast'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery card in your graveyard already has flashback, you may use either flashback ability to cast it from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you cast a spell from a graveyard using its flashback ability, you can’t pay other alternative costs (such as that of Foil).'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery with {X} in its mana cost this way, you still choose the value of X as part of casting the spell and pay that cost.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You may pay any optional additional costs the spell has, such as kicker costs. You must pay any mandatory additional costs the spell has, such as that of Tormenting Voice.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\'s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\'s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Akroma’s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn’t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because it’s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can’t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Dawn Charm\'s third mode can target a spell that has multiple targets, as long as at least one of those targets is you."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If Bridge from Below isn\'t in your graveyard immediately before a creature dies, its abilities won\'t trigger at all. If Bridge from Below isn\'t still in your graveyard as its first ability resolves, you won\'t create a token."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a nontoken creature you control and a creature an opponent controls die at the same time, you choose the order in which Bridge from Below\'s triggered abilities resolve. You can create a token before you exile Bridge from Below."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Neither ability cares who controlled the creature that died, only which graveyard it was put into. This means that if an opponent controls a creature you own, its death causes Bridge from Below\'s first ability to trigger, not its second."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "While Bridge from Below is on the battlefield, it has no effect. It does something only if it\'s in a graveyard. Yes, this is a bit weird."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If any abilities trigger on the creature entering the battlefield, those abilities resolve after you lose life. If losing life results in you losing the game, those abilities won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the creature you control from Reanimate is exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the mana value of the card in your graveyard, not the creature once it\'s on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'You lose life after the creature is already on the battlefield. Any abilities it has that interact with loss of life, such as that of Platinum Emperion, apply to that loss of life.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a creature you own dies at the same time that Sigil of the New Dawn leaves the battlefield, Sigil of the New Dawn\'s ability triggers for that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Sigil of the New Dawn\'s ability triggers if a creature you own dies under another player\'s control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If you activate Deranged Assistant\'s ability while casting a spell, you can\'t choose to rewind the ability once you see the card that was put into your graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put -1/-1 counters on Devoted Druid (due to an effect such as that of Solemnity), you can\'t activate its second ability. If you can put counters on it, but that is modified by an effect (such as that of Vizier of Remedies), you can activate the ability even if paying the cost causes no counters to be put on Devoted Druid."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "You put the -1/-1 counter on Devoted Druid as a cost to activate its ability, not when it resolves. If paying the cost causes Devoted Druid to have 0 toughness, it\'s put into your graveyard before you can untap it and before you can even pay the cost again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If you somehow manage to cast Urban Evolution when it\'s not your turn, you\'ll draw three cards when it resolves, but you won\'t be able to play a land that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Urban Evolutions in the same turn are cumulative. They\'re also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Explore."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Urban Evolution\'s effect allows you to play an additional land during your main phase. Doing so follows the normal timing rules for playing lands. In particular, you don\'t get to play a land as Urban Evolution resolves; Urban Evolution fully resolves first and you draw three cards, perhaps including a land you\'ll play later."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Thermo-Alchemist\'s activated ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Thermo-Alchemist\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered. Players can cast spells and activate abilities (such as Thermo-Alchemist\'s own activated ability) after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Which creature cards to return to your hand is determined as Garna\'s triggered ability resolves. If Garna somehow finds its way into your graveyard before that, perhaps due to the “legend rule,” it will be returned to your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A creature with 0 power can attack, as long as it doesn’t also have defender.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, and that planeswalker leaves the battlefield, that attacking creature can still be blocked. If it’s unblocked, the attacking creature is still attacking. It simply deals no combat damage.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the attacking creature leaves the battlefield before Raid Bombardment’s triggered ability resolves, Raid Bombardment deals 1 damage to the player or planeswalker that creature was attacking before it left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures with power 2 or less, Raid Bombardment’s ability triggers for each of them separately.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The power of the attacking creature is checked only when the ability triggers. Once it triggers, Raid Bombardment will deal 1 damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker even if the creature’s power changes before the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A land card that produces white mana, even a Plains, normally has no color.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Once you activate Mistveil Plains’s last ability, it doesn’t matter if you lose control of some of your white permanents.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'A land\\\'s copiable values are those printed on it, as modified by other copy effects. Counters and other effects aren\\\'t copied. Notably, if you copy a land that is also a creature because of a temporary effect (such as Celestial Colonnade), Thespian\\\'s Stage will become just the "unanimated" land.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'No enters-the-battlefield abilities of the land Thespian\\\'s Stage is copying will trigger. Thespian\\\'s Stage was already on the battlefield. Similarly, no "as this land enters the battlefield" or "this land enters the battlefield with" effects, such as that of Dark Depths, will apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "The copy effect created by the last activated ability doesn\'t have a duration. It will last until Thespian\'s Stage leaves the battlefield or another copy effect overwrites it. The permanent will no longer have the first ability of Thespian\'s Stage."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Thespian\'s Stage doesn\'t become untapped when it becomes a copy, even if the target land is untapped."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for Countersquall. The spell won’t be countered when Countersquall resolves, but its controller still loses 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Abilities that trigger whenever damage is dealt to you will still trigger because that damage is still dealt, even though your life total doesn’t change as a result.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Effects that replace an event with having you gain life (like Words of Worship’s effect does) or having you lose life will end up replacing the event with nothing.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Effects that would replace having you gain life with some other event won’t be able to be applied because it’s impossible for you to gain life.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a cost would include causing you to gain life (like the alternative cost of an opponent’s Invigorate does), that cost can’t be paid.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect says to set your life total to a certain number, that part of the effect won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect would cause you to exchange life totals with another player, the exchange won’t happen. Neither player’s life total changes.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'In a Commander game, the damage dealt to you by commanders will still be counted, even if that damage doesn’t cause you to lose life.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Platinum Emperion’s ability doesn’t prevent damage. Rather, it changes the results of that damage. For example, if a creature with lifelink deals damage to you, you won’t lose any life, but its controller will still gain that much life. Similarly, if a creature you control with lifelink deals damage to another player, that player will lose life but you won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that would normally cause you to gain or lose life still resolve, but the life-gain or life-loss part simply has no effect.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can’t pay a cost that includes the payment of any amount of life other than 0 life. However, you can choose to be dealt damage, even though that damage won’t result in your life total changing.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'An instant or sorcery spell is not a creature spell, even if that spell creates creature tokens.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a creature spell has generic mana only in its alternative or additional cost, the creature will still gain haste.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the mana is spent on a noncreature spell that becomes a creature later in the turn, that creature won’t have haste.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the mana is spent on two different creature spells, each of those spells (and resulting creatures) will gain haste until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Angelic Renewal’s ability triggers if a creature you own dies under another player’s control.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Angelic Renewal leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, you won’t be able to sacrifice it and the creature can’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a token creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, you can sacrifice Angelic Renewal, but nothing will be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an animated permanent that’s not normally a creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, Angelic Renewal can return that card to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures are put into your graveyard at once, Angelic Renewal triggers multiple times, but it can only be sacrificed once and only brings back one creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger on the Homunculus token entering the battlefield will resolve after you’ve sacrificed a creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The creature you sacrifice for the ability of Stitcher’s Apprentice could be the Homunculus you’ve just created. It could also be Stitcher’s Apprentice itself.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You create a token and sacrifice a creature all while the activated ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Any damage dealt to you by a Human will cause Mikaeus’s ability to trigger, including noncombat damage dealt to you by a Human and damage dealt to you by a Human you control.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a Human deals damage to you at the same time that Mikaeus is dealt lethal damage, Mikaeus’s triggered ability triggers. That Human will be destroyed even though Mikaeus has left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a non-Human creature you control without a +1/+1 counter dies at the same time as Mikaeus, that creature’s undying ability granted by Mikaeus triggers and will return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The +1/+1 bonus that Mikaeus gives to other non-Human creatures you control isn’t a counter. It won’t prevent undying from triggering.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Apprentice Necromancer can’t be the target of its own ability. This is because targets are chosen for activated abilities before costs (such as “Sacrifice Apprentice Necromancer”) are paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'As Slum Reaper’s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If any player controls no creatures, that player simply doesn’t sacrifice anything. Each other player still sacrifices a creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Slum Reaper may be the creature its controller sacrifices for its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'As a spell or ability an opponent controls resolves, if it would force you to sacrifice a permanent, you just don’t. That part of the effect does nothing. If that spell or ability gives you the option to sacrifice a permanent (as Desecration Demon does), you can’t take that option.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls states something happens unless you sacrifice a permanent (as Mogis, God of Slaughter does), you can’t choose to sacrifice a permanent. On the other hand, if a spell or ability an opponent controls instructs you to sacrifice a permanent unless you perform an action (as Killing Wave does), you can choose whether or not to perform the action. If you don’t perform the action, nothing happens, since you can’t sacrifice any permanents.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Sigarda’s ability affects only sacrifices. It won’t stop a creature from dying due to lethal damage or having 0 toughness, and it won’t stop a permanent from being put into its owner’s graveyard due to the “legend rule.” None of these are sacrifices; they’re the result of game rules.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to the enchanted creature may become lethal if you return Conviction to its owner’s hand during that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Players don’t have priority to cast spells and activate abilities between combat damage being assigned and being dealt. This means that if you want to return Conviction to its owner’s hand before combat damage is dealt, you must do so before combat damage is assigned (and the creature will no longer get +1/+3).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Firewing Phoenix’s ability can be activated only if Firewing Phoenix is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'For Emancipation Angel’s triggered ability, the permanent to return is chosen as the ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you choose the permanent and the time it’s returned to its owner’s hand.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Emancipation Angel is still on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, you may return Emancipation Angel itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Fume Spitter can be the target of its own ability. The ability won’t resolve since it won’t have a legal target, and no counter will be put on any creature, but this does allow you to sacrifice Fume Spitter without another creature to target if you want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Ghoulsteed’s ability can only be activated while it’s in your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'If Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the target creature indefinitely. This is different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if you lose the game, the creature exiled with Fiend Hunter remains exiled indefinitely. This is also different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Hissing Iguanar dies at the same time as another creature, Hissing Iguanar’s ability triggers.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Living Lore leaves the battlefield, the ability that defines its power and toughness will lose track of the exiled card. Its power and toughness are 0 in other zones.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell puts Living Lore onto the battlefield, that spell is still on the stack while you choose a card to exile. You can’t exile it with Living Lore.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If there are no instant or sorcery cards in your graveyard as Living Lore enters the battlefield, it will enter the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and be put into its owner’s graveyard due to having 0 toughness.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Living Lore’s last ability will trigger whenever it deals combat damage, no matter if that damage is dealt to an opponent, an opposing planeswalker, or a creature it’s blocking or being blocked by. You choose whether to sacrifice Living Lore as that ability resolves. If Living Lore has already left the battlefield, perhaps because it was dealt lethal damage at the same time it dealt damage, you can’t sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Similarly, if the exiled card somehow leaves exile while Living Lore is on the battlefield, it will become a 0/0 creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You may cast a sorcery this way even if it’s not your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Shirei leaves the battlefield and returns to the battlefield after a creature with power 1 or less is put into your graveyard, Shirei is considered a new object. The delayed triggered ability won’t return the creature to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Shirei’s ability can’t return any creatures that died before Shirei entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Shirei’s ability only triggers if the creature’s power immediately before leaving the battlefield is 1 or less, regardless of its power in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Shirei’s ability triggers if a creature you own with power 1 or less dies under another player’s control.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Squee isn’t in your graveyard as your upkeep begins, its ability won’t trigger. You can’t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Travel Preparations targets two creatures, and one of them is an illegal target by the time Travel Preparations resolves, you’ll still put a +1/+1 counter on the other creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can’t target the same creature twice to put two +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s hand has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the converted mana cost of that spell, even if it was cast for an alternative cost and no mana was spent on X.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s hand has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a discarded card has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target permanent or player becomes an illegal target for Blast of Genius, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw or discard any cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card (such as Spirit Cairn’s ability) trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can’t pay {W} multiple times to create more than one token each time you resolve Spirit Cairn’s triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Once the exiled creature returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect changes a creature’s power “until end of turn,” it will still have the modified power during your end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to draw cards and then discard cards, you can’t take actions in between. For example, if you have no cards in hand and cast Faithless Looting, you can’t activate Seismic Assault’s ability between the time you draw two cards and discard those two cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts Wickerbough Elder onto the battlefield with one or more +1/+1 counters, its -1/-1 counter and one of those +1/+1 counters are removed as a state-based action before you can activate its ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "You must choose a target artifact or enchantment to activate Wickerbough Elder\'s last ability. You can\'t pay {G} just to remove a -1/-1 counter from it without a legal target."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell deals damage to Lord of Extinction or lowers its toughness, that spell is put into its owner’s graveyard before state-based actions are performed. That card will raise Lord of Extinction’s toughness before the game checks to see if it dies.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The ability that defines Lord of Extinction’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Lord of Extinction is in your graveyard, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell puts Archaeomancer onto the battlefield, its ability can target that card in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an opponent hasn’t drawn any cards in a turn and a spell or ability instructs that player to draw multiple cards, that player will just draw one card. However, if the draws are optional, the player can’t choose to draw, even if they could draw one card this way.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you and a permanent you control each become the target of the same spell or ability an opponent controls, Leovold’s ability will trigger twice. The same is true if two permanents you control become the target of the same spell or ability an opponent controls.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Leovold will “see” cards drawn by opponents earlier in the turn before it entered the battlefield, although Leovold can’t affect cards drawn before it entered the battlefield. For example, if an opponent draws two cards, then Leovold enters the battlefield, that opponent can’t draw more cards that turn, but the two drawn cards are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Replacement effects (such as that of dredge or Laboratory Maniac’s ability) can’t be used to replace draws that Leovold disallows. However, if an opponent’s first draw is replaced (by a dredge ability, for example), that draw didn’t happen and Leovold won’t stop the next draw.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Your opponents can draw a maximum of one card each on each player’s turn. Subsequent card draws during that turn are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If both targets are illegal, Vengeful Rebirth doesn’t resolve. It will be put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target card in your graveyard becomes an illegal target but the target permanent or player doesn’t, Vengeful Rebirth won’t return that card to your hand and it won’t deal any damage (because you didn’t return a nonland card to your hand this way). Vengeful Rebirth will still be exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target permanent or player becomes an illegal target but the target card in your graveyard doesn’t, Vengeful Rebirth will still return that card from your graveyard to your hand, but it won’t deal any damage. Vengeful Rebirth will then be exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can return a land card to your hand with Vengeful Rebirth. It just won’t deal any damage to the target permanent or player if you do.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Prey Upon resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the chosen target becomes an illegal target for Warleader’s Helix, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the only blue or red permanent you control is a creature that’s dealt lethal damage at the same time as Wandering Champion deals combat damage, Wandering Champion’s ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you don’t control a blue or red permanent as Wandering Champion’s ability resolves, you can’t discard and draw a card. The blue or red permanent you control as the ability resolves doesn’t have to be one you controlled as the ability triggered.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Wandering Champion’s ability doesn’t trigger if you don’t control a blue or red permanent immediately after it deals combat damage to a player.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target for Seize the Day, the spell doesn’t resolve. There isn’t an additional combat phase or main phase.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you somehow cast Seize the Day during an opponent’s main phase, that opponent attacks during the resulting combat phase, since it’s still that player’s turn. If you somehow cast it not during a main phase at all, all that happens is you untap the target creature.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Seize the Day can target a creature that’s already untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Flight of Fancy tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If there is only one card in your library, you put it into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you target any cards in a graveyard and those cards all become illegal targets, the target player simply shuffles their library.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Stream of Consciousness can’t be one of the target cards you shuffle into your library.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You choose the target cards; the target player doesn’t. They may offer suggestions.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You may target zero cards in any graveyard and have a target player simply shuffle their library.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you target one creature and that target is illegal as Repel the Darkness resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you target two creatures and they’re both illegal as Repel the Darkness resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve; you don’t draw a card. If just one target is illegal, the spell does resolve; the remaining legal target becomes tapped (if it’s untapped at that time) and you draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you target zero creatures, all that happens is you draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You may target zero, one, or two creatures. The creatures don’t need to be untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If you win the flip, Molten Birth goes directly from the stack to its owner’s hand. It never goes to a graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the Aura you control from Iridescent Drake’s ability is exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Iridescent Drake’s triggered ability can target any Aura card in a graveyard. However, if the Aura can’t be attached to Iridescent Drake, it remains in its owner’s graveyard and doesn’t enter the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player loses the game, triggered abilities that player controls are removed from the stack and no more from that player can be added. This means that if a creature an opponent controls dies while you control Fecundity, and you lose the game before Fecundity’s triggered ability resolves (perhaps because you lost the game at the same time that the creature died), that player won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Marang River Prowler checks if you control a black or green permanent only as you begin to cast it. Once you begin to cast Marang River Prowler from your graveyard, it doesn’t matter what happens to the black or green permanents you control.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions and pay its cost to cast Marang River Prowler from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'No player may take actions between the time the creature returns to the battlefield and the time you put a +1/+1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The creature returns to the battlefield without a +1/+1 counter on it. Any abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield will trigger or not as appropriate before it receives the +1/+1 counter and resolve after it has received that counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Rise from the Tides is still on the stack while you count the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard. It doesn’t count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Skywing Aven’s last ability can be activated only while it’s on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can activate Skywing Aven’s ability, then activate it again before that ability resolves. You may do this as many times as you’d like before resolving any of those abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The Myr Servitor that’s the source of the triggered ability must still be on the battlefield when the ability resolves. If it is, all other Myr Servitor cards are returned from all graveyards to the battlefield under their owner’s control. If it’s not, no Myr Servitors are returned to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The ability that defines Boneyard Wurm’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Boneyard Wurm is in your graveyard, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The damage dealt by Balefire Dragon’s triggered ability isn’t combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The power and toughness of the Ooze token is determined when Miming Slime resolves. It won’t change as the greatest power among creatures you control changes.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The value of X is the greatest power among creatures you control when Miming Slime resolves. If you control no creatures at that time, X will be 0, creating a 0/0 Ooze token that will be put into your graveyard as a state-based action (unless something else is raising its toughness).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'The spell can\\\'t be countered if the mana produced by Cavern of Souls is spent to cover any cost of the spell, even an additional cost such as a kicker cost. This is true even if you use the mana to pay an additional cost while casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact can\'t be chosen."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can activate the ability of Olivia’s Dragoon more than once in a turn, even if it already has flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Bloodflow Connoisseur to pay the cost for its own ability. In this case, nothing happens as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Magmaw to pay the cost for its own ability. It still deals 1 damage to the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You choose an opponent while Canker Abomination is entering the battlefield. No player may take actions between the time you choose the opponent and the time Canker Abomination gets -1/-1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You determine whether you’ll draw one or three cards as Visions of Beyond begins to resolve. This means that if you have nineteen cards in your graveyard and use a dredge ability to replace the one card draw, you won’t draw two more cards after that even though your graveyard now has twenty cards in it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose the name of a card that’s still in your library, or even a card that’s in your deck at all. If no card with the chosen name is in your library, you exile your library and lose 1 life for each of those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You draw two cards and discard three cards all while the activated ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Frantic Search is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose which lands to untap as the spell resolves. They aren\'t targeted, and they don\'t have to be lands that you control."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target card is an illegal target by the time Pulse of Murasa tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 6 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Runed Halo can\'t protect you from tokens unless those tokens have the same name as the card name you choose."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Some cards can have alternative names, such as split cards, adventurer cards, double-faced cards, and so on. You may choose one of the two names the card can have; Runed Halo won\'t protect you from the other name."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A game that restarts immediately ends the preceding game. The players in that game then immediately begin a new game. No player wins, loses, or draws the original game as a result of Karn\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "After the pregame procedure is complete but before the new game\'s first turn, Karn\'s ability finishes resolving and the cards left in exile are put onto the battlefield. If this causes any triggered abilities to trigger, those abilities are put onto the stack at the beginning of the first upkeep step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Any permanents put onto the battlefield with Karn\'s ability that entered the battlefield tapped will untap during their controller\'s first untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the permanents you control from Karn\'s ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a Commander game, each player puts their commander into the command zone before shuffling their deck, unless it was exiled with Karn. In that case, the commander remains in exile and will be put onto the battlefield when Karn\'s ability finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, any player who left the game before it was restarted with Karn\'s ability won\'t be involved in the new game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Karn\'s first and third abilities are linked. Similarly, Karn\'s second and third abilities are linked. Only non-Aura permanent cards exiled by either of Karn\'s first two abilities will remain in exile when the game restarts."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "No actions taken in the game that was restarted apply to the new game. For example, if you were dealt damage by Stigma Lasher in the original game, the effect that states you can\'t gain life doesn\'t carry over to the new game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Permanents put onto the battlefield due to Karn\'s ability will have been under the starting controller\'s control continuously since the beginning of that player\'s first turn. Creatures among them can attack and their activated abilities with {T} in the cost can be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Players can\'t move cards between their deck and sideboard before the new game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Players won\'t have any counters or emblems they had in the original game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The number of times a player has cast their commander from the command zone resets to zero. The amount of combat damage dealt to players by each commander is reset to 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The player who controlled the ability that restarted the game is the starting player in the new game. The new game starts like a game normally does: Each player shuffles their deck (except the cards left in exile by Karn\'s ability). Each player\'s life total becomes 20 (or the starting life total for whatever format you\'re playing). Players draw a hand of seven cards. Players may take mulligans. Players may take actions based on cards in their opening hands, such as those of Leylines."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Colorless mana won\'t give Engineered Explosives another charge counter. Colorless is not a color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Tokens that aren\'t a copy of something else don\'t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can choose any value for X as you cast Engineered Explosives. The value chosen for X doesn\'t directly affect the number of charge counters Engineered Explosives enters the battlefield with, but it does let you pay more mana and thus spend more colors of mana to cast it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Maelstrom Pulse tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t destroy any permanents at all. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do destroy other permanents with the same name."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Maelstrom Pulse has only one target. Other permanents with the same name will be destroyed even if they have hexproof or protection.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The name of a token is the same as the subtypes it was created with unless the token is a copy of another permanent or the effect that created the token specifically gives it a different name. For example, a 1/1 red Elemental creature token created by Young Pyromancer and a 4/4 green Elemental creature token created by Walker of the Grove are both named “Elemental.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Vengevine\'s ability triggers only for the second creature spell you cast in a turn. It won\'t trigger for the third, fourth, or so on. It also doesn\'t matter how many noncreature spells you cast in a turn; the ability counts only the creature spells."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Vengevine\'s triggered ability checks the spells you cast over the course of the entire turn, not just the ones you cast while Vengevine is in your graveyard. For example, if you cast a creature spell, then Vengevine is put into your graveyard, then you cast another creature spell, Vengevine\'s ability triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Vengevine\'s triggered ability works only if Vengevine is already in your graveyard as you finish casting your second creature spell in a turn and if it remains there until the triggered ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you declare exactly one creature as an attacker, each exalted ability on each permanent you control (including, perhaps, the attacking creature itself) will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, a creature “attacks alone” if it\'s the only creature declared as an attacker by your entire team. If you control that attacking creature, your exalted abilities will trigger but your teammate\'s exalted abilities won\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Some effects put creatures onto the battlefield attacking. Since those creatures were never declared as attackers, they\'re ignored by exalted abilities. They won\'t cause exalted abilities to trigger. If any exalted abilities have already triggered (because exactly one creature was declared as an attacker), those abilities will resolve as normal even though there may now be multiple attackers."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You must attack with exactly one creature for exalted abilities to trigger. Exalted abilities won\'t trigger if you attack a player with one creature and a planeswalker with another, for example, or if you attack with two creatures but one is removed from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Furnace Celebration itself doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice any permanents. Its ability triggers whenever you sacrifice a permanent because something else instructed you to."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay {2} more than once each time Furnace Celebration\'s ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to pay {2} as the ability resolves, if that target is still legal. No player may take actions between the time you pay {2} and the time damage is dealt.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If either target is an illegal target as Soul\'s Fire resolves, no damage is dealt."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The triggered ability triggers both when Crow of Dark Tidings enters the battlefield and when it dies. You don\'t have to choose only one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Loyalty abilities of planeswalkers are activated abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Faith\'s Fetters doesn\'t stop static abilities, triggered abilities, or mana abilities from working. A mana ability is an ability that produces mana, not an ability that costs mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Faith\'s Fetters tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because delve isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Delve doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise\'s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can\'t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can\'t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Containment Priest\'s last ability won\'t affect any creatures that were cast, including ones cast from unusual zones such as your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Containment Priest enters the battlefield at the same time as other creatures, its ability won\'t affect those creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Containment Priest enters the battlefield without being cast, its ability won\'t exile itself."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a noncreature card wasn\'t cast and is entering the battlefield as a creature (due to an effect such as that of March of the Machines), it will be exiled. Conversely, if a creature card wasn\'t cast and is entering the battlefield as a noncreature permanent (for example, Heliod, Sun-Crowned with insufficient devotion), it won\'t be exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a resolving spell puts Eternal Witness onto the battlefield, Eternal Witness\'s ability can target that card if it\'s put into your graveyard as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an effect such as that of Magus of the Moon causes Urborg to lose its abilities by setting it to a basic land type not in addition to its other types, it won\'t turn lands into Swamps, no matter in what order those effects started to apply."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Land cards not on the battlefield aren\'t Swamps while Urborg is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Urborg\\\'s ability causes each land on the battlefield to have the land type Swamp. Any land that\\\'s a Swamp has the ability "{T}: Add {B}." Nothing else changes about those lands, including their names, other subtypes, other abilities, and whether they\\\'re legendary, basic, or snow.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth isn\'t a Swamp while it\'s not on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell deals damage to Tarmogoyf or lowers its toughness, that spell is put into its owner\'s graveyard before state-based actions are performed. If that card is the first of its type to enter a graveyard, it will raise Tarmogoyf\'s toughness before the game checks to see if Tarmogoyf dies."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Tarmogoyf counts card types, not cards. If the only card in all graveyards is a single artifact creature, Tarmogoyf will be 2/3. If the only cards in all graveyards are ten artifact creatures, Tarmogoyf will still be 2/3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Tarmogoyf\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Tarmogoyf is in your graveyard, it will count itself."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The card types that can appear on cards in a graveyard are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal. Legendary, basic, and snow are supertypes, not card types.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Shriekmaw\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Shriekmaw."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If X is 0, Conflagrate has no targets and deals no damage.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining the mana value of that spell, even if it was cast with flashback and no mana was spent on X.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If some of the targets become illegal for Conflagrate, the original division of damage still applies, but the damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets isn’t dealt at all.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You divide the damage as you cast Conflagrate, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. You can’t choose more than X targets and assign 0 damage to a target.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Arcane is a spell subtype that has no inherent rules meaning. It may be referenced by effects from other cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise’s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Grave Scrabbler’s madness cost was paid if you cast it using its madness ability, even if an effect changed the amount of mana you paid for that cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If for some reason you can’t win the game (because your opponent has cast Angel’s Grace this turn, for example), you won’t lose for having tried to draw a card from a library with no cards in it. The draw was still replaced.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If two or more players each control a Laboratory Maniac and each player is instructed to draw a number of cards, first the player whose turn it is draws that many cards. If this causes that player to win the game instead, the game is immediately over. If the game isn’t over yet, repeat this process for each other player in turn order.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Activating the ability creates a replacement effect that acts like a shield, replacing the next time Patchwork Gnomes would be destroyed that turn. This shield works against effects that try to destroy Patchwork Gnomes or lethal damage that would be dealt to Patchwork Gnomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Patchwork Gnomes can regenerate even if it isn\'t in combat, it\'s already tapped, or it\'s undamaged."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can activate the regeneration ability even if Patchwork Gnomes isn\'t at risk of being destroyed. Sometimes you need to discard cards. We understand."}]', "[{'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'A pile can be empty. If the player chooses an empty pile, no permanents will be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'When Liliana’s first ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'When Liliana’s third ability resolves, you put each permanent the player controls into one of the two piles. For example, you could put a creature into one pile and an Aura enchanting that creature into the other pile.'}, {'date': '2022-09-09', 'text': 'You can activate Liliana’s first ability even if some or all players will be unable to discard a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Undying Rage tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It\'s put into its owner\'s graveyard from the stack rather than from the battlefield, so its last ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You might end up discarding the card you searched for. It\'s a gamble!"}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Count the number of cards in your graveyard as Circular Logic resolves to determine how much the controller of the target spell has to pay. Circular Logic is still on the stack at that time. It doesn’t count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Dark Depths doesn’t have a mana ability. It doesn’t tap for colorless mana.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Dark Depths leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, you won’t be able to sacrifice it, so you won’t create Marit Lage.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The last ability of Dark Depths is a state trigger. It won’t trigger again while the ability is on the stack, but if the ability is countered and Dark Depths is still on the battlefield with no ice counters on it, it will trigger again immediately.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'ただの風', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nマッドネス{U}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「別に心配するようなことじゃないわ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456910&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c423da45-29fd-41b8-83e7-d5cebb61c65c', 'multiverseId': 456910}, 'multiverseid': 456910}]", "[{'name': 'ならず者の道', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '泥棒達の間では、想像を絶する宝が眠る壁のない迷宮についての噂が瞬く間に広まった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457100&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '200cc938-4cdf-41af-9a31-b76f5629af62', 'multiverseId': 457100}, 'multiverseid': 457100}]", "[{'name': 'ぬめるボーグル', 'text': '呪禁', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': 'オグル？ボーグル？ゴーグル？ボグル？気にするな。どうせ捕まえられなかったんだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457073&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fffed101-1724-41c9-8013-3bd35ad650d2', 'multiverseId': 457073}, 'multiverseid': 457073}]", "[{'name': 'わめき騒ぐマンドリル', 'text': '探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\nトランプル', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 類人猿', 'flavor': 'スゥルタイ領土へ侵入した侵入者たちの多くは、クロコダイルのエサかヒヒたちのおもちゃのいずれかの末路を迎える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457020&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3feb028a-e182-4b93-8b0e-163d979131f5', 'multiverseId': 457020}, 'multiverseid': 457020}]", "[{'name': 'アイケイシアの触れ役', 'text': '{1}{W}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる：白の１/１の市民・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・スペルシェイパー', 'flavor': '彼女の故郷から数千年が失われた今、彼女の戦争の知らせは理由を失ったが、無意味になったわけではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456872&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45c20fca-9974-4913-ab60-e36a8fa80e85', 'multiverseId': 456872}, 'multiverseid': 456872}]", "[{'name': 'アクロスの十字軍', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたがアクロスの十字軍を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、速攻を持つ赤の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': 'アクロスの兵士の価値は、その者の鬨の声に呼応して上がった剣の本数で決められる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456971&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9f4dea1-beb8-440b-95ba-c729e4bf38c3', 'multiverseId': 456971}, 'multiverseid': 456971}]", "[{'name': 'イロアスの英雄', 'text': 'あなたがオーラ・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n英雄的 ― あなたがイロアスの英雄を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、イロアスの英雄の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '「我が左腕はサイクロプスを、右腕は巨人を倒してきた。戦いには常にこの双腕をもって臨む。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456870&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e78c6192-02a4-4b71-a55f-0f3d24b68950', 'multiverseId': 456870}, 'multiverseid': 456870}]", "[{'name': 'ウラモグの破壊者', 'text': '滅殺２（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント２つを生け贄に捧げる。）\\n各戦闘で、ウラモグの破壊者は可能なら攻撃する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルドラージ', 'flavor': '「ウラモグは死んだ。その血統も死につつある。そのことを分かっていないものもいるようだが。」\\n――孤独な宣教師、ニルトゥ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456858&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8632718-1d3c-4f30-afa2-0674a1c79c29', 'multiverseId': 456858}, 'multiverseid': 456858}]", "[{'name': 'エルドラージの徴兵', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋10/＋10の修整を受けトランプルと滅殺２を持つ。（それが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント２つを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': '部族・エンチャント — エルドラージ・オーラ', 'flavor': 'エルドラージの力をほんの少し味わうだけで、王国と自我の両方が粉砕される。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456853&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbc1dc69-fbf4-48ea-80a3-31ede6ce27de', 'multiverseId': 456853}, 'multiverseid': 456853}]", "[{'name': 'エレンドラ谷の大魔導師', 'text': '飛行\\n{U}, エレンドラ谷の大魔導師を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\\n頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456908&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7e914db-6ea7-464a-8f5b-b97158ab35dd', 'multiverseId': 456908}, 'multiverseid': 456908}]", "[{'name': 'オリヴィアの竜騎兵', 'text': 'カード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、オリヴィアの竜騎兵は飛行を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・狂戦士', 'flavor': 'ヴォルダーレンの血への渇望が輝くのは、華やかな晩餐や豪勢なパーティーのみではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456959&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e47d3cb5-2a7f-492b-b1f1-f503b4243da0', 'multiverseId': 456959}, 'multiverseid': 456959}]", "[{'name': 'カラカス', 'text': '{T}：{W}を加える。\\n{T}：伝説のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': '伝説の土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457094&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e59f2d9b-1bf7-4fce-9738-fc8cd549fcb3', 'multiverseId': 457094}, 'multiverseid': 457094}]", "[{'name': 'ガドック・ティーグ', 'text': '点数で見たマナ・コストが４以上でクリーチャーでない呪文は唱えられない。\\nマナ・コストに{X}を含みクリーチャーでない呪文は唱えられない。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — キスキン・アドバイザー', 'flavor': '彼の知恵と魂の偉大さに、彼と出会った人の多くが、大いなる人の前に立ち、四つの風の中で最も賢い者と話をしたと語る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457049&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58fdbbbe-f5d4-4b06-b5e6-8db96795f922', 'multiverseId': 457049}, 'multiverseid': 457049}]", "[{'name': 'ギャンブル', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探してあなたの手札に加え、カード１枚を無作為に選んで捨てる。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「ガラクタに、ボロに、弾だ！」\\n――「喧嘩腰」号の砲手、ブリーチェス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456982&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7cadf60-20bb-4acc-82f7-6eb7d6fa7a2d', 'multiverseId': 456982}, 'multiverseid': 456982}]", "[{'name': 'グルマグのアンコウ', 'text': '探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・魚', 'flavor': 'グルマグ沼にいるすべての存在が人の肉を欲するのであれば、これ以上効果的なおとりがあるだろうか？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456952&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e726579-725f-41fe-8b4e-33c0e3e2bc9f', 'multiverseId': 456952}, 'multiverseid': 456952}]", "[{'name': 'グール呼びの共犯者', 'text': '{3}{B}, あなたの墓地からグール呼びの共犯者を追放する：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': '「箱に入っちまえば皆同じさ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456946&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3228f2b1-28a6-4948-9b52-68ef1cd0bdad', 'multiverseId': 456946}, 'multiverseid': 456946}]", "[{'name': 'グール馬', 'text': '{2}{B}, カード２枚を捨てる：あなたの墓地からグール馬をタップ状態で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・馬', 'flavor': 'かつては聖戦士の道見張りを乗せ、村々の交差路を巡回していた。今でも同じ道を歩き続けている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456947&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0721c17-f569-4cdc-83c7-22533bfdec22', 'multiverseId': 456947}, 'multiverseid': 456947}]", "[{'name': 'コジレックの職工', 'text': 'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\\n滅殺２（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント２つを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルドラージ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456852&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '190b2aee-1aa8-4642-866e-7b769ee3b704', 'multiverseId': 456852}, 'multiverseid': 456852}]", "[{'name': 'ゴブリンの太守スクイー', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはあなたの墓地からゴブリンの太守スクイーをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン', 'flavor': '「ヨーグモスにとってスクイーの不死身は呪いのつもりだったとしても、スクイーにそう告げる者はいなかった。」\\n――カーン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457000&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a58338c-33a3-4cc2-903a-2d08a9fb713b', 'multiverseId': 457000}, 'multiverseid': 457000}]", "[{'name': 'ゴルガリの凶漢', 'text': 'ゴルガリの凶漢が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\\n発掘４（あなたがカードを１枚引くなら、代わりにあなたのライブラリーの一番上からちょうど４枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からこのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。そうしなかったなら、カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456948&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86d835b1-8fbc-4623-882d-51b11f4e874d', 'multiverseId': 456948}, 'multiverseid': 456948}]", "[{'name': 'ゴルガリの墓トロール', 'text': 'ゴルガリの墓トロールは、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}, ゴルガリの墓トロールの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：ゴルガリの墓トロールを再生する。\\n発掘６', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トロール・スケルトン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457017&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50b59163-e44b-4d67-97a8-7d4e2ffbf26d', 'multiverseId': 457017}, 'multiverseid': 457017}]", "[{'name': 'ゴルガリの茶鱗', 'text': 'ゴルガリの茶鱗があなたの墓地からあなたの手札に加えられたとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n発掘２（あなたがカードを１枚引くなら、代わりにあなたのライブラリーの一番上からちょうど２枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からこのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。そうしなかったなら、カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トカゲ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457016&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbb59e0c-7327-4a56-9840-08a8c059766d', 'multiverseId': 457016}, 'multiverseid': 457016}]", "[{'name': 'ゴルガリの魔除け', 'text': '以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• ターン終了時まで、クリーチャーはすべて－１/－１の修整を受ける。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n• あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーをそれぞれ再生する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「ラヴニカ中で嘲笑させておけばいい。どのみち全員が地底街にやってくるのだ。」\\n――ジャラド', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457051&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfc729c1-f131-4586-b26a-65ae8ee5a3a9', 'multiverseId': 457051}, 'multiverseid': 457051}]", "[{'name': 'サテュロスの道探し', 'text': 'サテュロスの道探しが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚公開する。あなたは、その中から土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サテュロス', 'flavor': 'お祭りの後に目覚めた最初のサテュロスは、次のお祭りの現場を探さなければならない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457030&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38b791e6-5b76-4560-a3cf-499ff1d360f5', 'multiverseId': 457030}, 'multiverseid': 457030}]", "[{'name': 'スゥルタイの頭蓋守り', 'text': 'スゥルタイの頭蓋守りが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ナーガ・シャーマン', 'flavor': '宮殿の射手たちが侵入者たちを殲滅した後、最初に到来するのが頭蓋守りである。頭蓋守りは遺体の脳から選りすぐりの知識を探り出すのである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456925&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d6b370a-df2d-44b7-90a8-3776b4bcf5e0', 'multiverseId': 456925}, 'multiverseid': 456925}]", "[{'name': 'タルモゴイフ', 'text': 'タルモゴイフのパワーはすべての墓地にあるカードのカード・タイプの総数に等しく、タフネスはその値に１を足したものに等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ルアゴイフ', 'flavor': '育たぬものは、死ぬ。そして死んだものがタルモゴイフを育てる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457037&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d56719a-1186-499d-a0f0-65f666b0ecc2', 'multiverseId': 457037}, 'multiverseid': 457037}]", "[{'name': 'ダクムーアの回収場', 'text': 'ダクムーアの回収場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n発掘２（あなたがカードを１枚引くなら、代わりにあなたのライブラリーの一番上からちょうど２枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からこのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。そうしなかったなら、カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457090&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c603f49-165a-44fd-a606-3570f611d221', 'multiverseId': 457090}, 'multiverseid': 457090}]", "[{'name': 'チェイナーの布告', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{B}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456939&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bb75061-4af1-4326-96df-4ac339e22a1e', 'multiverseId': 456939}, 'multiverseid': 456939}]", "[{'name': 'テツモスの大神官', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたがテツモスの大神官を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック', 'flavor': '「死は圧政である。他の圧政と同様に、それは抵抗されなければならない。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456890&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c8f46f1-41d4-411e-b1ee-ce3a9e568d33', 'multiverseId': 456890}, 'multiverseid': 456890}]", "[{'name': 'ディミーアのギルド魔道士', 'text': '{3}{U}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\\n{3}{B}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457063&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50fb2cb1-bcec-416f-ae35-bfbef352a7b2', 'multiverseId': 457063}, 'multiverseid': 457063}]", "[{'name': 'トレストの使者、レオヴォルド', 'text': '各ターン、各対戦相手はそれぞれ、カードを２枚以上引くことができない。\\nあなたかあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントが、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文か能力の対象になるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・アドバイザー', 'flavor': '「合意していただけると思っていますよ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457052&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6e6d420-b3b1-44e5-a0d8-b2d65a1530fd', 'multiverseId': 457052}, 'multiverseid': 457052}]", "[{'name': 'トロウケアの敷石', 'text': '{T}：{W}を加える。\\nトロウケアの敷石が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探してタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': '伝説の土地', 'flavor': 'その石は埃混じりの風に浸食されてしまったが、大地は未だに力を携えたままだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457093&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd32da47c-a268-4d27-8c3c-e107ee1dede6', 'multiverseId': 457093}, 'multiverseid': 457093}]", "[{'name': 'ネクロマンサーの弟子', 'text': '{B}, {T}, ネクロマンサーの弟子を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。そのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード', 'flavor': '自ら望んでその生涯を屍術に捧げた魔道士。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456934&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92a47100-2626-4d1f-aed4-ea2f7266dc2c', 'multiverseId': 456934}, 'multiverseid': 456934}]", "[{'name': 'ハイエナの陰影', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け先制攻撃を持つ。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456871&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82be902f-b9e7-4f6e-b5a8-31a7ffaa1e98', 'multiverseId': 456871}, 'multiverseid': 456871}]", "[{'name': 'バザールの大魔術師', 'text': '{T}：カードを２枚引き、その後カード３枚を捨てる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「物を商う者もあれば、秘密を商う者もある。私が提供するのは、未来へ赴いた魂がもたらす、可能性という名の珍しい硬貨だ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456913&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d6130a1-91e7-454a-9684-7706c14e3d4a', 'multiverseId': 456913}, 'multiverseid': 456913}]", "[{'name': 'パッチワーク・ノーム', 'text': 'カード１枚を捨てる：パッチワーク・ノームを再生する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ノーム', 'flavor': '魔術師のがらくたは、別の魔術師には嫌悪すべき放浪集団となる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457081&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d90e0b8-c25c-4e15-bf62-332433688ae2', 'multiverseId': 457081}, 'multiverseid': 457081}]", "[{'name': 'ファイレクシアの供犠台', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '「偉大なるヨーグモス、不純な者の皮を剥ぎ、肉がその祝福を受け入れますように。」\\n――ファイレクシアの聖句', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457082&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcf0c7d4-bf7f-4bdc-9268-7c2ddfbc949f', 'multiverseId': 457082}, 'multiverseid': 457082}]", "[{'name': 'ファイレクシアの塔', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：{B}{B}を加える。', 'type': '伝説の土地', 'flavor': '「ヨーグモスは死に、その城塞は虚しく横たわっている。しかし、なりふり構わず力を求める者は、いつの時代にも現れるものだ。」\\n――カーン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457098&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33e1a467-bce1-4527-9a81-d896c058fc60', 'multiverseId': 457098}, 'multiverseid': 457098}]", "[{'name': 'ヘリオッドの巡礼者', 'text': 'ヘリオッドの巡礼者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーからオーラ・カード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': 'ヘリオッドの祝福は、すべての者が目にできるほど明らかである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456869&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8737f9fb-38e4-47cd-8104-2a14cae64d7f', 'multiverseId': 456869}, 'multiverseid': 456869}]", "[{'name': 'マイアの苦役者', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、マイアの苦役者が戦場にある場合、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分の墓地から「マイアの苦役者」という名前のカードをすべて戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア', 'flavor': 'クラーク族はこれを引き裂き、それぞれが互いを修復するのを見て喜ぶ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457080&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f1e8a9e-3147-4100-8956-2d4052bd122e', 'multiverseId': 457080}, 'multiverseid': 457080}]", "[{'name': 'マウアー地所の双子', 'text': 'マッドネス{2}{B}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': '「お嬢ちゃんたち、ご両親はどちらかな？」\\n――放浪のモンク、レイグの最後の言葉', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456968&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee175568-182e-479c-b1d2-595009989520', 'multiverseId': 456968}, 'multiverseid': 456968}]", "[{'name': 'マハモティ・ジン', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': 'マハモティ・ジンは大気の精霊たちの中でも高貴な血筋につながり、風の翼で空を駆ける。彼は計略と詐術の名手であり、戦場はもちろん、賭博場においても危険な存在となる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456914&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77437ed5-e029-4eeb-86c4-673c12a4f8d4', 'multiverseId': 456914}, 'multiverseid': 456914}]", "[{'name': 'マラング川をうろつくもの', 'text': 'マラング川をうろつくものではブロックできず、マラング川をうろつくものはブロックされない。\\nあなたが黒か緑のパーマネントをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたはあなたの墓地からマラング川をうろつくものを唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': 'マラング川の水流が足跡も血痕もすべて洗い流す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456915&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91633e79-2c2b-452d-83da-3f9c6248f7b7', 'multiverseId': 456915}, 'multiverseid': 456915}]", "[{'name': 'マンモスの陰影', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456874&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0275de6-a203-4617-8f75-3d387975ae35', 'multiverseId': 456874}, 'multiverseid': 456874}]", "[{'name': 'ムラーサの胎動', 'text': '墓地からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたは６点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「可憐な花の千々に咲き、なれの墓より茂るごと、試練の兵よ戻り来て、共に再び戦わん。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457029&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8147611-a23f-4719-a88d-606914923e88', 'multiverseId': 457029}, 'multiverseid': 457029}]", "[{'name': 'ヨーグモスの墳墓、アーボーグ', 'text': '各土地はそれぞれ、それの他の土地タイプに加えて沼でもある。', 'type': '伝説の土地', 'flavor': '「ヨーグモスの屍は宇宙にとっての傷跡だ。彼の穢れた血は滲み出し、最後の呪いで土地を汚染している。」\\n――ウィンドグレイス卿', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457104&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebf50b44-490f-4390-9b6d-3bf0af4113fc', 'multiverseId': 457104}, 'multiverseid': 457104}]", "[{'name': 'ラクドスの切り刻み教徒', 'text': '速攻', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・狂戦士', 'flavor': '「もし魂ってもんがあるなら、そいつはきっと胆嚢の裏っ側、腎臓のちょっと上にあるはずだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457069&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a6f6ff1-5033-46b6-8dac-700d13b70100', 'multiverseId': 457069}, 'multiverseid': 457069}]", "[{'name': 'ルーンのほつれ', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが、{2}に加えて、すべての墓地にある「ルーンのほつれ」という名前のカード１枚につき{2}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「集中が鍵だ。それが無くば、魔道士が術で生み出すのは割れるような頭痛のみだ。」\\n――結界師ズアー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456918&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37e9f88f-6a30-40e0-b8bc-6b1e45e2da03', 'multiverseId': 456918}, 'multiverseid': 456918}]", "[{'name': 'ルーンの光輪', 'text': 'ルーンの光輪が戦場に出るに際し、カード名１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたはプロテクション（その選ばれた名前）を持つ。（あなたはその名前のものによって、対象にならず、ダメージを与えられず、エンチャントされない。）', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456884&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f3fee81-91ff-40a8-a856-f80e3d6ab600', 'multiverseId': 456884}, 'multiverseid': 456884}]", "[{'name': 'レイナ塔の英雄', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたがレイナ塔の英雄を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、レイナ塔の英雄の上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '「その種子があなたの心に事前に埋め込まれていない限り、偉人となることは到底叶わないでしょう。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457019&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eec6d638-7d9a-4151-8aec-20476b716a10', 'multiverseId': 457019}, 'multiverseid': 457019}]", "[{'name': 'ロノムの一角獣', 'text': 'ロノムの一角獣を生け贄に捧げる：エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ユニコーン', 'flavor': '常軌を逸した霧氷風の魔術を感じ取った一角獣たちは、北方の荒原から再び戦場へ帰ってきた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456883&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '715cecbf-da08-4456-83fe-4bd69dff51f9', 'multiverseId': 456883}, 'multiverseid': 456883}]", "[{'name': 'ヴェールのリリアナ', 'text': '+1：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\\n-2：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n-6：プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているパーマネントすべてを２つの束に分ける。そのプレイヤーは束１つを選び、その束にあるすべてのパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — リリアナ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456954&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4ca4b17-935a-4979-ad85-94b019a8c062', 'multiverseId': 456954}, 'multiverseid': 456954}]", "[{'name': '不安定性突然変異', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーのコントローラーのアップキープの開始時に、そのクリーチャーの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456930&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a64a289-7fbd-4e3c-b1bb-cef1ff24c321', 'multiverseId': 456930}, 'multiverseid': 456930}]", "[{'name': '不浄なる者、ミケウス', 'text': '威嚇\\n人間が１体あなたにダメージを与えるたび、それを破壊する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて人間でない他のクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け不死を持つ。（不死を持つクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていない場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456956&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18815e14-d173-4550-a495-60e3492982fb', 'multiverseId': 456956}, 'multiverseid': 456956}]", "[{'name': '不浄な飢え', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタントやソーサリーであるカードが２枚以上あるなら、あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'リリアナは天使たちの目を惹くことを、自らの力の証であると考えていた。しかしながら、それは彼女にとって鬱陶しいことでもあった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456970&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58f59f0b-4146-432a-98fd-ba908e621f78', 'multiverseId': 456970}, 'multiverseid': 456970}]", "[{'name': '二度裂き', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '初めはうまく行かなくても、もう一回攻撃するのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457064&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f54be2b4-2e67-4929-92f4-b3c56bfeae9e', 'multiverseId': 457064}, 'multiverseid': 457064}]", "[{'name': '亡霊招き', 'text': '墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。飛行を持ち白であり黒である１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ロビーにはそれが要求しながらも決して手に取ることができない小銭が散乱している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457061&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4b24660-9af1-4c71-ad31-dd722bcc99de', 'multiverseId': 457061}, 'multiverseid': 457061}]", "[{'name': '今を生きる', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。このメイン・フェイズの後に追加の戦闘フェイズ１つと、それの後に追加のメイン・フェイズを１つ加える。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456997&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5a6ba7a-e0e1-4e2e-8f53-a31fcbbaa136', 'multiverseId': 456997}, 'multiverseid': 456997}]", "[{'name': '仕組まれた爆薬', 'text': '烈日（これは、これを唱えるために支払われたマナの色１色につき蓄積カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\n{2}, 仕組まれた爆薬を生け贄に捧げる：点数で見たマナ・コストが仕組まれた爆薬の上に置かれた蓄積カウンターの数に等しく、土地でない各パーマネントをそれぞれ破壊する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457077&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5171e47f-e7e0-43de-be1b-2f9cd36d80d2', 'multiverseId': 457077}, 'multiverseid': 457077}]", "[{'name': '信仰の足枷', 'text': 'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\n信仰の足枷が戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\nエンチャントされているパーマネントでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力はマナ能力でないかぎり起動できない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456866&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08ff2b70-ad3f-4159-95d5-2de7ea486f74', 'multiverseId': 456866}, 'multiverseid': 456866}]", "[{'name': '信仰無き物あさり', 'text': 'カードを２枚引き、その後カード２枚を捨てる。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「アヴァシンは我々を見捨てたのだ！我々に残されたものは、自分で掴み取れる物だけだ！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456978&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f948cb0-e63d-4747-91d5-de7f47542507', 'multiverseId': 456978}, 'multiverseid': 456978}]", "[{'name': '信条の戦士', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたが信条の戦士を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、信条の戦士の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '彼女は怪物と対峙した時から、その墓碑銘を考え始める。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457035&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0cde50a-28f5-4701-9f79-5778e0e6a193', 'multiverseId': 457035}, 'multiverseid': 457035}]", "[{'name': '僻地の灯台', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}：カードを１枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '突風やハリケーン、人殺しの霊魂の大波を人知れず迎える孤独な歩哨。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457092&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf5eae21-acff-4159-9088-4682de86242b', 'multiverseId': 457092}, 'multiverseid': 457092}]", "[{'name': '全ては塵', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしている有色のパーマネントをすべて生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '部族・ソーサリー — エルドラージ', 'flavor': '「エルドラージが目覚めたからって悪いことばかりじゃないさ。お前さんの人生が後悔の無い完璧に満たされたやつだったんならな。」\\n――オンドゥの遺物狩り、ジャヴァド・ナスリン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456851&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd2ce96e-486f-4d4d-8664-41315322e56c', 'multiverseId': 456851}, 'multiverseid': 456851}]", "[{'name': '再活性', 'text': '墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。あなたはそれの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを失う。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「これに見合う値打ちがあるといいわね。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456960&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d3582f2-c706-48aa-94cc-014856c9d502', 'multiverseId': 456960}, 'multiverseid': 456960}]", "[{'name': '再誕のパターン', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーは「そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード１枚を探して戦場に出し、その後自分のライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457026&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d1e4616-88b1-4f31-9195-24e899641441', 'multiverseId': 457026}, 'multiverseid': 457026}]", "[{'name': '反重力', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\\nフラッシュバック{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '多元宇宙のどこにでも魔法があり、誰かがそれを使って飛んでいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456898&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1014361a-d4d9-45c8-af9e-e17e1f2dab56', 'multiverseId': 456898}, 'multiverseid': 456898}]", "[{'name': '古えの墳墓', 'text': '{T}：{C}{C}を加える。古えの墳墓はあなたに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '死者の王国では、得るべき栄光など存在しない。\\n――ヴェクの墓碑銘', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457086&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3398df92-8b6f-4966-b97c-528eeabac678', 'multiverseId': 457086}, 'multiverseid': 457086}]", "[{'name': '古術師', 'text': '古術師が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「力の言葉は消えない。意志ある者が必要とするときまで眠りにつくのだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456895&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e471a09-847f-4bfc-8a9b-3f767daa17fc', 'multiverseId': 456895}, 'multiverseid': 456895}]", "[{'name': '叫び大口', 'text': '畏怖（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。）\\n叫び大口が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n想起{1}{B}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456963&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c56bf937-91db-4c58-8150-86a860021066', 'multiverseId': 456963}, 'multiverseid': 456963}]", "[{'name': '台所の嫌がらせ屋', 'text': '台所の嫌がらせ屋が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — アウフ', 'flavor': 'アウフの頼みを一つ引き受けたら、さらに引き受ける羽目になる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457066&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63d7c99a-99c8-45e8-b658-081d69901881', 'multiverseId': 457066}, 'multiverseid': 457066}]", "[{'name': '吸血鬼の印', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、絆魂を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「私の与える『病状』は一つの試練だ。弱き者は蝕まれる。強き者は超越する。」\\n――ソリン・マルコフ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456955&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15db9599-fb62-4ec3-8094-56c1a495e3e7', 'multiverseId': 456955}, 'multiverseid': 456955}]", "[{'name': '土地守', 'text': '{1}{G}：あなたの墓地から基本土地・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド', 'flavor': '「教会は遺産という点で考えるが、他の者は永遠という点で考える。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457018&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc873fec-10d8-44f2-8ac7-87ff99f52d6a', 'multiverseId': 457018}, 'multiverseid': 457018}]", "[{'name': '基本に帰れ', 'text': '基本でない土地は、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '「支配者は宝冠をかぶり、我々は帽子をかぶる。しかし、雨のときにはどちらがいいだろうか。」\\n――バリン、真理集', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456896&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9ffd41f-7505-4cf4-893b-cfd7100bb349', 'multiverseId': 456896}, 'multiverseid': 456896}]", "[{'name': '堂々巡り', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーがあなたの墓地にあるカード１枚につき{1}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\nマッドネス{U}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456897&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2852798-f436-4d6a-af9b-726245e9b449', 'multiverseId': 456897}, 'multiverseid': 456897}]", "[{'name': '墓を掻き回すもの', 'text': 'マッドネス{1}{B}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）\\n墓を掻き回すものが戦場に出たとき、これのマッドネス・コストが支払われていた場合、墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456950&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7ce32d5-041f-4dc9-8601-475f63bf1367', 'multiverseId': 456950}, 'multiverseid': 456950}]", "[{'name': '墓所の力', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚あなたの墓地に置く。その後、そのクリーチャーの上に、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '生の後に死が続く限り、スゥルタイの補給線が途切れることはない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456951&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3b9e9af-8e2a-4d45-8a57-32677aafe193', 'multiverseId': 456951}, 'multiverseid': 456951}]", "[{'name': '壌土からの生命', 'text': 'あなたの墓地から土地・カード最大３枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n発掘３（あなたがカードを１枚引くなら、代わりにあなたのライブラリーの一番上からちょうど３枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からこのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。そうしなかったなら、カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457022&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6691947-ef1f-4815-8e10-36b517d31d7c', 'multiverseId': 457022}, 'multiverseid': 457022}]", "[{'name': '夜明けの宝冠', 'text': 'エンチャント（他のオーラがつけられているクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け先制攻撃と警戒と絆魂を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「清らかな曙光が、神々の欺瞞を屈服させますように。」\\n――オレスコスの王、ブリマーズ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456864&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1404a0e-fe48-47b8-a10c-d13888a653c8', 'multiverseId': 456864}, 'multiverseid': 456864}]", "[{'name': '夜鳥の手中', 'text': 'クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。このターン、それらのクリーチャーではブロックできない。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '光るほど磨かれた銀は多くの怪物に対する結界となるが、それ以外を引き寄せもする。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456991&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ec2d73a-0922-4dfa-87e1-ba503f55cb1a', 'multiverseId': 456991}, 'multiverseid': 456991}]", "[{'name': '夢次元の芸術家', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる, 土地１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探して戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・スペルシェイパー', 'flavor': '彼は土地を転がす技を熟知している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456902&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '024f0515-b7df-4811-9cfe-420a0092500a', 'multiverseId': 456902}, 'multiverseid': 456902}]", "[{'name': '大あわての捜索', 'text': 'カードを２枚引き、その後カード２枚を捨てる。土地最大３つをアンタップする。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'トレイリア西部では時間操作が禁止された。学生たちに時間の大切さを教えるためである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456907&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd145b59-4536-485d-b326-6c8f0ea98525', 'multiverseId': 456907}, 'multiverseid': 456907}]", "[{'name': '大渦の脈動', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それと、そのパーマネントと同じ名前を持つ他のすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '断片が繋がりあう中で、あらゆる生き様が何の跡も残さず消えうせた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457054&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca3b0e40-9867-400a-9389-e3a95dd7e9c2', 'multiverseId': 457054}, 'multiverseid': 457054}]", "[{'name': '大爆発の魔道士', 'text': '大爆発の魔道士を生け贄に捧げる：基本でない土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・シャーマン', 'flavor': '「燃えろ、苦しめ、これ以上邪魔をするな。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457065&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbf4ee00-4c74-4d23-8055-75599cb88e5b', 'multiverseId': 457065}, 'multiverseid': 457065}]", "[{'name': '大霊堂の戦利品', 'text': 'カード名１つを選ぶ。その名前を持つカードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。その後そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。これにより公開された他のカードをすべて追放し、あなたはそれらの追放されたカード１枚につき１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456966&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '203499f2-6bc5-4637-ad36-cbbbb90767b1', 'multiverseId': 456966}, 'multiverseid': 456966}]", "[{'name': '天才の煽り', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。カードを３枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。天才の煽りはそのパーマネントやプレイヤーに、捨てたカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ラル・ザレックのひらめきは本物の雷光をほとばしらせる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457047&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15fc2251-3150-4f36-8e13-e9295861cf3d', 'multiverseId': 457047}, 'multiverseid': 457047}]", "[{'name': '天界の列柱', 'text': '天界の列柱はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\\n{3}{W}{U}：ターン終了時まで、天界の列柱は飛行と警戒を持ち白であり青である４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457088&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f41979a-e9f5-4b3e-890c-806619840628', 'multiverseId': 457088}, 'multiverseid': 457088}]", "[{'name': '天馬の乗り手', 'text': '飛行\\n英雄的 ― あなたが天馬の乗り手を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、天馬の乗り手の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': 'ペガサスが受け入れる唯一のくつわは、信頼である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456893&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f2a0eb0-1532-41c6-9cff-c750915882f3', 'multiverseId': 456893}, 'multiverseid': 456893}]", "[{'name': '失われたアラーラの君主', 'text': '賛美（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーからそのクリーチャーにエンチャントできるオーラ・カード１枚を探し、そのクリーチャーにつけられた状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457057&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aee2649b-1168-412a-a552-5bf00273aeaf', 'multiverseId': 457057}, 'multiverseid': 457057}]", "[{'name': '奇跡の復活', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「我は都市国家の礎である。死は我を鍛えるだけに過ぎぬ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456876&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f764bba9-fd77-484f-95c6-f397951ed5df', 'multiverseId': 456876}, 'multiverseid': 456876}]", "[{'name': '安寧砦の精鋭', 'text': '頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト', 'flavor': '死をもってしても任務を諦めさせることはできない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457070&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2cc836d-7991-45a4-8edf-1cca945cdbd9', 'multiverseId': 457070}, 'multiverseid': 457070}]", "[{'name': '宝船の巡航', 'text': '探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\nカードを３枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '無数の歓楽が水面上に浮かぶ間も、暗き陰謀が水面下で展開されている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456929&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a9d9d64-7930-4e04-a628-dc4ce0223aa2', 'multiverseId': 456929}, 'multiverseid': 456929}]", "[{'name': '密集軍の指揮者', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたが密集軍の指揮者を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '彼の兵士は、彼の言葉を盾の内側に刻み込む。それは戦いの中で常に兵士らの目の前にあり、励みとなっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456877&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5aa65bb6-7d45-45d3-a003-1d4a50a9f038', 'multiverseId': 456877}, 'multiverseid': 456877}]", "[{'name': '対抗突風', 'text': 'クリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。それのコントローラーは２点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'エスパーの二十三の風には名が与えられ、記録にとどめられ、魔法の流れとあらゆる関わりが余すところ無く記述されている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457048&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '559acbc5-2e2d-418f-ad3e-a7588cb4348c', 'multiverseId': 457048}, 'multiverseid': 457048}]", "[{'name': '封じ込める僧侶', 'text': '瞬速\\nトークンでないクリーチャーが、それが唱えられることなく戦場に出るなら、代わりにそれを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': '防御によっては、多少技巧が必要となることもあります。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456861&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcec3773-baa2-480e-9d33-bc827cb794d0', 'multiverseId': 456861}, 'multiverseid': 456861}]", "[{'name': '屑嗅ぎ鼻', 'text': '瞬速\\n屑嗅ぎ鼻が戦場を離れたとき、墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n想起{B}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456958&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22853918-daad-4b16-810d-740c901af835', 'multiverseId': 456958}, 'multiverseid': 456958}]", "[{'name': '屑山の人形', 'text': '屑山の人形を生け贄に捧げる：墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ', 'flavor': '「どこかの晩で、戻ってこなくなるんだろうね。そしたら、そいつの仕事は本当に終わったって事さ。」\\n――纏め鍛治のブラエナ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457078&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cded3bc-59d4-488c-a3ef-dd70e750ac20', 'multiverseId': 457078}, 'multiverseid': 457078}]", "[{'name': '崇敬の壁', 'text': '防衛、飛行\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得てもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・壁', 'flavor': 'エルフの寿命は長いが、彼らの記憶はさらに長い。死んでから後も、彼らは故郷を見捨てないのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456891&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05b92393-7829-4bda-9285-c51d3975a49a', 'multiverseId': 456891}, 'multiverseid': 456891}]", "[{'name': '広漠なる変幻地', 'text': '{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探してタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '二歩北へ進めば不安定な未来、南へ進めば不穏な過去、東に進めば今日この日、西へ進めば偉大なる未知。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457102&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '391899b4-4971-4254-816e-bbc8123b9b6e', 'multiverseId': 457102}, 'multiverseid': 457102}]", "[{'name': '引き裂かれし永劫、エムラクール', 'text': 'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nあなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。\\n飛行、プロテクション（有色の呪文）、滅殺６\\n引き裂かれし永劫、エムラクールがいずれかの領域から墓地に置かれたとき、これのオーナーは自分の墓地を自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456854&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '215449cb-ae75-471a-8d94-91c7ad8aea67', 'multiverseId': 456854}, 'multiverseid': 456854}]", "[{'name': '弱さからの脱皮', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。あなたはそれの上から－１/－１カウンターを１個取り除いてもよい。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '活力の試練に備えてナーガは古い皮を脱ぎ捨てる。傷跡や疑念や恐怖も同時に払い落とす。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457031&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89431ba4-ee50-42db-b90f-5cc3400baad3', 'multiverseId': 457031}, 'multiverseid': 457031}]", "[{'name': '強大化', 'text': '探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋６/＋６の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457007&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '398ec24b-505b-4d72-a402-be2d5504cdfb', 'multiverseId': 457007}, 'multiverseid': 457007}]", "[{'name': '彼方の映像', 'text': 'カードを１枚引く。いずれかの墓地にあるカードが20枚以上なら、代わりにカードを３枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「現在に存在する全てにとって、過去は基盤である。我々は先祖がすでに見つけたものを再構築するに過ぎぬ。」\\n――記憶の賢者、サチミール', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456931&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1717e126-d4ea-4304-abe0-89a23ac9c6ff', 'multiverseId': 456931}, 'multiverseid': 456931}]", "[{'name': '御霊の復讐', 'text': 'あなたの墓地から伝説のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。そのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\\n連繋（秘儀）{2}{B}（あなたが秘儀・呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはあなたの手札からこのカードを公開して、連繋コストを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、このカードの効果をその呪文に加える。）', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456949&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85cab871-7c95-48e4-b478-ab067d7e4e13', 'multiverseId': 456949}, 'multiverseid': 456949}]", "[{'name': '復讐に燃えた再誕', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からカード１枚と、プレイヤー１人かクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。その前者をあなたの手札に戻す。これにより土地でないカードをあなたの手札に戻したなら、復讐に燃えた再誕はその後者に、その前者の点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n復讐に燃えた再誕を追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457059&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ad0c763-92c2-4164-a802-36305799baa8', 'multiverseId': 457059}, 'multiverseid': 457059}]", "[{'name': '復讐蔦', 'text': '速攻\\nあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、それがこのターンにあなたが唱えた２つ目のクリーチャー・呪文である場合、あなたはあなたの墓地から復讐蔦を戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': 'それは放置された根の一欠片からですら復活し、活力をみなぎらせる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457039&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f120690d-1dae-48e7-9092-dedb6fcf6e67', 'multiverseId': 457039}, 'multiverseid': 457039}]", "[{'name': '忌むべき者の歌', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき{B}を加える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '風ではなく、死者の息遣いだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456965&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0611984e-36f8-42b4-95ac-dc504e1ec457', 'multiverseId': 456965}, 'multiverseid': 456965}]", "[{'name': '忍び寄るタール坑', 'text': '忍び寄るタール坑はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\\n{1}{U}{B}：ターン終了時まで、忍び寄るタール坑は青であり黒である３/２のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。このターン、これはブロックされない。これは土地でもある。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457089&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e42e618b-b6d4-49b4-bf00-ff4aa4f96ad9', 'multiverseId': 457089}, 'multiverseid': 457089}]", "[{'name': '怒り狂う山峡', 'text': '怒り狂う山峡はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。\\n{2}{R}{G}：ターン終了時まで、怒り狂う山峡は「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。」を持ち赤であり緑である３/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457099&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7174fd2-582d-4f0b-a6c0-0237048e6fa2', 'multiverseId': 457099}, 'multiverseid': 457099}]", "[{'name': '悪鬼の狩人', 'text': '悪鬼の狩人が戦場に出たとき、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\\n悪鬼の狩人が戦場を離れたとき、その追放されたカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456867&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66751f47-35b7-44e8-b0f9-0ff374b4549c', 'multiverseId': 456867}, 'multiverseid': 456867}]", "[{'name': '悪魔の教示者', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '悪魔の気前の良さには裏がある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456943&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99fe4216-5a01-45b6-873a-07c5ed9f85eb', 'multiverseId': 456943}, 'multiverseid': 456943}]", "[{'name': '意識の流れ', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人と、そのプレイヤーの墓地からカード最大４枚を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、それらのカードを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': '「すべての物ははじめに戻る。水が神滝より海に落つるは、雨となって再び剛き川に戻り集うため。」\\n――落葉の道三', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456924&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e04b5f87-7728-49ec-9e95-1f2b32ecea22', 'multiverseId': 456924}, 'multiverseid': 456924}]", "[{'name': '憤怒', 'text': '速攻\\n憤怒があなたの墓地にあり、あなたが山をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — インカーネーション', 'flavor': '「溶けた大地自体は怒っているわけではない。そこにおのれの激怒を吹き込むことで、マグマは沸き返り、形を成す。」\\n――槌のコス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456972&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '867901d7-f2fc-485d-a200-76f4396af339', 'multiverseId': 456972}, 'multiverseid': 456972}]", "[{'name': '戦導者のらせん', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。戦導者のらせんはそれに４点のダメージを与え、あなたは４点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「敵の無知に情けをかけている暇はありません。吹き飛ばしてやりなさい。」\\n――オレリア', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457060&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59bfb5f2-e2f9-4bcd-a6eb-64779b0b1492', 'multiverseId': 457060}, 'multiverseid': 457060}]", "[{'name': '手練', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、もう１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「魔道士との賭けは賭けじゃない。」\\n――神々しき老修道士、レミン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456920&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14336016-e858-42e2-85e2-eac2ce585137', 'multiverseId': 456920}, 'multiverseid': 456920}]", "[{'name': '押し潰す梢', 'text': '以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「上空からの見晴らしの良さを、安全と勘違いしてはならない。」\\n――形成師のトゥヴァーサ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457011&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcd7e0a7-2403-4d64-818b-b8e6b0a447a9', 'multiverseId': 457011}, 'multiverseid': 457011}]", "[{'name': '捕食', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「年取った狼男狩りはほとんどいないよ。」\\n――ソンバーワルドの罠師、パーリン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457028&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e39fdfc8-822f-4072-bf5a-256c6ba6069c', 'multiverseId': 457028}, 'multiverseid': 457028}]", "[{'name': '捨て身の儀式', 'text': '{R}{R}{R}を加える。\\n連繋（秘儀）{1}{R}（あなたが秘儀・呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはあなたの手札からこのカードを公開して、連繋コストを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、このカードの効果をその呪文に加える。）', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456977&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd49e5c46-279e-420f-8340-6c56da4cc06b', 'multiverseId': 456977}, 'multiverseid': 456977}]", "[{'name': '掘葬の儀式', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '誰もが祝福された眠りを切望する。それを得られる者はほとんどいない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456969&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88aae2cf-d10d-4631-a81c-b9443eee6f42', 'multiverseId': 456969}, 'multiverseid': 456969}]", "[{'name': '撃退', 'text': 'あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、島・カード１枚と他のカード１枚を捨ててもよい。\\n呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '魔術師にありがちな失敗は、タイミングを外すことである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456905&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caff306c-ac22-4b48-8243-85023db92c11', 'multiverseId': 456905}, 'multiverseid': 456905}]", "[{'name': '撹乱する群れ', 'text': 'あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたの手札から点数で見たマナ・コストがＸの青のカード１枚を追放してもよい。\\n呪文１つを対象とする。それの点数で見たマナ・コストがＸであるなら、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456901&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd52a6f51-4d06-4936-8633-d94af6676962', 'multiverseId': 456901}, 'multiverseid': 456901}]", "[{'name': '放浪する勇者', 'text': '放浪する勇者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたが青か赤のパーマネントをコントロールしている場合、あなたはカードを１枚捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': '「敵から学ぶのはいいけど、許容はしないことね。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456892&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '296a5c1c-2017-4472-88d7-dfd0a4bf713e', 'multiverseId': 456892}, 'multiverseid': 456892}]", "[{'name': '新たな夜明けの印形', 'text': 'クリーチャーが１体戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは{1}{W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、そのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': 'その印は死の彼方までも色あせることのない栄誉をかたどったものだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456885&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '158ef934-60b1-46b0-8621-a4570615e45d', 'multiverseId': 456885}, 'multiverseid': 456885}]", "[{'name': '新緑の幻霊', 'text': '{G}, 新緑の幻霊を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ３点を加える。\\nあなたが多色の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはあなたの墓地から新緑の幻霊をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457040&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7946d03-4548-4558-b5e5-8e48887f2d58', 'multiverseId': 457040}, 'multiverseid': 457040}]", "[{'name': '旅の準備', 'text': 'クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '旅の始まりに神殿を訪れることは、旅が終わることをより確かにする。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457038&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcd5f4f3-d651-4d77-9265-66413ae4e209', 'multiverseId': 457038}, 'multiverseid': 457038}]", "[{'name': '旋風の達人', 'text': '呪禁\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン・モンク', 'flavor': '滑運棒術では攻めと守りを区別しない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456932&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '913e86b9-37dc-45cf-8ddd-c326dfce8fa1', 'multiverseId': 456932}, 'multiverseid': 456932}]", "[{'name': '日を浴びるルートワラ', 'text': '{1}{G}：ターン終了時まで、日を浴びるルートワラは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。この能力は、毎ターン１回のみ起動できる。\\nマッドネス{0}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トカゲ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457006&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '611901ed-6c37-48ec-a3a3-9f13efb6923c', 'multiverseId': 457006}, 'multiverseid': 457006}]", "[{'name': '時を越えた探索', 'text': '探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを７枚見る。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456900&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63cae9ee-f154-4a1e-9773-1c4cd6f2cb3d', 'multiverseId': 456900}, 'multiverseid': 456900}]", "[{'name': '時間操作', 'text': 'このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '土壇場で何かをするってことは、そう捨てたもんじゃないさ。自分でそのときを最後の土壇場にできるならね。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456927&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0e5c734-d725-4bb9-823e-ab890952a4b8', 'multiverseId': 456927}, 'multiverseid': 456927}]", "[{'name': '暁の魔除け', 'text': '以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• このターン、与えられる戦闘ダメージをすべて軽減する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを再生する。\\n• あなたを対象とする呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456863&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e220a1d-2a88-4c30-b3eb-931a1a2a508e', 'multiverseId': 456863}, 'multiverseid': 456863}]", "[{'name': '暗影のワーム', 'text': 'トランプル\\n暗影のワームが死亡したとき、トランプルを持つ黒の６/６のワーム・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ワーム', 'flavor': 'その恐怖は一人の生涯には収まり切らない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457027&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6b89a6e-00f6-4677-98c5-db37116db993', 'multiverseId': 457027}, 'multiverseid': 457027}]", "[{'name': '暗黒の深部', 'text': '暗黒の深部は、氷カウンターが10個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{3}：暗黒の深部の上から氷カウンターを１個取り除く。\\n暗黒の深部の上に氷カウンターがないとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、「マリット・レイジ」という名前で飛行と破壊不能を持つ黒の20/20の伝説のアバター・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': '伝説の氷雪土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457091&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01faa7cc-6511-43f7-92da-49a464a5736a', 'multiverseId': 457091}, 'multiverseid': 457091}]", "[{'name': '最後の喘ぎ', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－３の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '武勇の場で倒れることは、死を意味するわけではない。ただし、壮絶な痛みを伴わないわけでもない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456953&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e3694e0-f4b0-4cef-a295-93e2eed69736', 'multiverseId': 456953}, 'multiverseid': 456953}]", "[{'name': '木立を歩むもの', 'text': '木立を歩むものが戦場を離れたとき、緑の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n想起{4}{G}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457041&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a108aa8c-9ec1-4baf-9dd7-1fa9eaed714f', 'multiverseId': 457041}, 'multiverseid': 457041}]", "[{'name': '木霊の手の内', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探して公開し、その１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出し、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー — 秘儀', 'flavor': '「地の育つは、神の望む所のみ。」\\n――落葉の道三', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457021&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '356b27d6-9928-419a-af04-8d324795ee72', 'multiverseId': 457021}, 'multiverseid': 457021}]", "[{'name': '枝細工下げの古老', 'text': '枝細工下げの古老は－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{G}, 枝細工下げの古老の上から－１/－１カウンターを１個取り除く：アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・シャーマン', 'flavor': '「生けるカカシは自然の秩序のまがい物じゃ。死んだやつならいい帽子になるじゃろ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457042&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a63ba36-4e22-4cfe-b5d7-1b1ff9ddb771', 'multiverseId': 457042}, 'multiverseid': 457042}]", "[{'name': '棘投げの蜘蛛', 'text': '到達\\n棘投げの蜘蛛が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛', 'flavor': '最も美味しい獲物とは、自分が危険に遭わなくなっていると思い込んだ怠け者だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457036&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd87c8c83-377b-4ac1-983c-0d106b763dee', 'multiverseId': 457036}, 'multiverseid': 457036}]", "[{'name': '森滅ぼしの最長老', 'text': 'トランプル\\n森滅ぼしの最長老が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーでないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457045&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e3f6383-97ed-408f-a676-b2957468a53b', 'multiverseId': 457045}, 'multiverseid': 457045}]", "[{'name': '死せざる怒り', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受け、それではブロックできない。\\n死せざる怒りが戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、死せざる怒りをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457003&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7100f1a-1adf-4656-987e-152fa36cd842', 'multiverseId': 457003}, 'multiverseid': 457003}]", "[{'name': '死の否定', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードＸ枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': '竹沼は呻きと叫びと嘆きの声に満ち満ちている。ある声は生きている者から、ある声は死にゆく者から発せられるが、最も恐ろしいのは死者からの声だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456942&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf327ef3-b03a-4ef5-8e43-08225c4485c6', 'multiverseId': 456942}, 'multiverseid': 456942}]", "[{'name': '死蔵の世話人、死零', 'text': 'パワーが１以下のクリーチャーが１体戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、死蔵の世話人、死零が依然として戦場にあるなら、あなたはそのカードを戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456962&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13d9e476-52b5-4834-8aa1-8998402813e5', 'multiverseId': 456962}, 'multiverseid': 456962}]", "[{'name': '残忍なレッドキャップ', 'text': '残忍なレッドキャップが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。これはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・暗殺者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457067&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e928e518-ab9c-49b9-8936-77d0f7f201d3', 'multiverseId': 457067}, 'multiverseid': 457067}]", "[{'name': '永遠の証人', 'text': '永遠の証人が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': '彼女は語られたすべての言葉を覚えている。それは英雄の誓いから、赤ん坊の泣き声にまで至る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457013&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c300edb4-f9ce-4e1f-b814-6c92d52d1a0c', 'multiverseId': 457013}, 'multiverseid': 457013}]", "[{'name': '汚れ背の匪賊', 'text': 'トランプル\\n頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457071&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2146f0ca-ad7e-4242-993e-2d1d9f1cc4a2', 'multiverseId': 457071}, 'multiverseid': 457071}]", "[{'name': '活発な野生林', 'text': '活発な野生林はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。\\n{1}{G}{W}：ターン終了時まで、活発な野生林は到達を持ち緑であり白である３/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457101&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6d8280b-5e3c-4348-95de-e7438e0dc3e9', 'multiverseId': 457101}, 'multiverseid': 457101}]", "[{'name': '流血の鑑定人', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：流血の鑑定人の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': '「生存ではなく、虚栄と悦楽のための死だと？そうした退廃こそ、私が食い止めようとしたものだ。」\\n――ソリン・マルコフ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456936&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bef2c00-23d2-4a8e-9bf1-dbdbd6bc675f', 'multiverseId': 456936}, 'multiverseid': 456936}]", "[{'name': '溶口', 'text': '{1}, 土地でないパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。溶口はそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '「存在の意義は明白だ。全ては溶口の燃料に過ぎぬ。」\\n――溶口の崇拝者、ジャジー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456988&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd758091a-b86d-4194-ba9a-099ef43ce7d5', 'multiverseId': 456988}, 'multiverseid': 456988}]", "[{'name': '溶岩の撃ち込み', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。溶岩の撃ち込みはそれに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー — 秘儀', 'flavor': '巧妙な呪法ではないが、意図は伝わる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456986&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fb6e1bf-52b4-4c0c-81c4-da62694ded78', 'multiverseId': 456986}, 'multiverseid': 456986}]", "[{'name': '溶岩爪の辺境', 'text': '溶岩爪の辺境はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。\\n{1}{B}{R}：ターン終了時まで、溶岩爪の辺境は「{X}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持ち黒であり赤である２/２のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457095&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '666b4b66-23a3-40b1-bcca-6e34fbc654ba', 'multiverseId': 457095}, 'multiverseid': 457095}]", "[{'name': '溶鉄の誕生', 'text': '赤の１/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。その後、コイン投げをする。あなたがコイン投げに勝ったなら、溶鉄の誕生をオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「マグマの中にいるクリーチャーに熱を冷まして出てくるよう説得できる奴なんて、そうそういるもんじゃない。」\\n――槌のコス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456990&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8bf5ea3-74f1-4dc8-85f8-65ee19c58ba1', 'multiverseId': 456990}, 'multiverseid': 456990}]", "[{'name': '滋養の群れ', 'text': 'あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたの手札から点数で見たマナ・コストがＸの緑のカード１枚を追放してもよい。\\nあなたはＸ点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457025&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab0d006b-d783-4f63-a3e0-64df98a8b0db', 'multiverseId': 457025}, 'multiverseid': 457025}]", "[{'name': '演劇の舞台', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：土地１つを対象とする。演劇の舞台は、この能力を持つことを除きそれのコピーになる。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '戦争の噂が広まるなか、ギルドパクトの赦しの第３幕は大急ぎで悲劇として書き改められた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457103&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10dca76c-bef1-4253-9a17-ca6934e66817', 'multiverseId': 457103}, 'multiverseid': 457103}]", "[{'name': '潮からの蘇生', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にありインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚につき、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体タップ状態で生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「愛する弟へ。貴方の玩具をルーデヴィックと分け合うことにしたのはさぞ楽しかろうと思います。そうそう、私も新しい遊び相手を見つけたところなのですよ。」\\n――グール呼びのギサ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456917&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbc2afa9-b551-425f-b4e5-bd013eed593b', 'multiverseId': 456917}, 'multiverseid': 456917}]", "[{'name': '火 // 氷', 'text': 'クリーチャーやプレイヤーを、１つまたは望む組み合わせで２つ対象とする。火はそれらに、２点のダメージをあなたの好きなように分割して与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '火', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457075&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1932ef7-c6ff-4708-851c-cec56def4fc2', 'multiverseId': 457075}, 'multiverseid': 457075}]", "[{'name': '火翼のフェニックス', 'text': '飛行\\n{1}{R}{R}{R}：あなたの墓地から火翼のフェニックスをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — フェニックス', 'flavor': '「フェニックスが火山に巣を作るのは吉兆だ。それは百年の戦を意味する。」\\n――ケルドの大将軍、ゴルマーク', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456980&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '554bef43-65e9-4a7a-9c8b-6e46e18adb29', 'multiverseId': 456980}, 'multiverseid': 456980}]", "[{'name': '火花吐き', 'text': '{R}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる：「火花の精霊」という名前の赤の３/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。それはトランプルと速攻と「終了ステップの開始時に、火花の精霊を生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・スペルシェイパー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456999&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '457e7fed-5e29-41a0-9e2e-ab98b6923c47', 'multiverseId': 456999}, 'multiverseid': 456999}]", "[{'name': '災火のドラゴン', 'text': '飛行\\n災火のドラゴンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、これはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーにそれぞれその点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': 'お前の方向に向かってきたなら、勇敢に死ぬかあっという間に死ぬか――望む死を選ぶといい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456974&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ac5273d-d4e8-4d78-9079-0c29174f9618', 'multiverseId': 456974}, 'multiverseid': 456974}]", "[{'name': '炉の式典', 'text': 'あなたが他のパーマネントを１つ生け贄に捧げるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、炉の式典はそれに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '自分たちを確実に殺しそうなものに、ゴブリンは感動するのである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456981&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9e148cc-f470-48f7-baf4-609050cb9b8e', 'multiverseId': 456981}, 'multiverseid': 456981}]", "[{'name': '無謀なるワーム', 'text': 'トランプル\\nマッドネス{2}{R}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ワーム', 'flavor': '大闘技場で戦わせるために繁殖されていたワームは、野に放たれたときに生態系すべてを全滅させた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456994&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9c471d7-d645-4497-a02a-6c3d07367b70', 'multiverseId': 456994}, 'multiverseid': 456994}]", "[{'name': '無謀なる突進', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋０の修整を受け速攻を得る。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456993&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0d9335d-d291-4c45-87b9-cae5680bd7a9', 'multiverseId': 456993}, 'multiverseid': 456993}]", "[{'name': '無限に廻るもの、ウラモグ', 'text': 'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n破壊不能\\n滅殺４（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント４つを生け贄に捧げる。）\\n無限に廻るもの、ウラモグがいずれかの領域から墓地に置かれたとき、これのオーナーは自分の墓地を自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456857&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '568d3e8b-1258-4883-a86a-0027ff8a3fef', 'multiverseId': 456857}, 'multiverseid': 456857}]", "[{'name': '煙霧吐き', 'text': '煙霧吐きを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ホラー', 'flavor': '「我が射手たちは、それが金屑の山を登る最中に転んだのを見てからかっていたよ。転げ落ちてきても自分たちは安全だと思っていたが、その邪悪なるものが運んできたのは単なる屍気ではなかったんだ。」\\n――絡み森の狩人、アダラン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456945&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab1d3d64-6a33-4ced-b471-7f5d65d82a20', 'multiverseId': 456945}, 'multiverseid': 456945}]", "[{'name': '熟慮', 'text': 'カードを１枚引く。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「私が必要な呪文は、知ってるか、間もなく知るかだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456928&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40fb923a-688b-4daa-a1f2-167d00c06410', 'multiverseId': 456928}, 'multiverseid': 456928}]", "[{'name': '熱錬金術師', 'text': '防衛\\n{T}：熱錬金術師は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、熱錬金術師をアンタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': '「天才が火をつけた精神には、狂気は無縁だ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457001&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ee0921c-991a-476b-b364-7a830b2188e9', 'multiverseId': 457001}, 'multiverseid': 457001}]", "[{'name': '燃焼', 'text': 'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤー、望む数を対象とする。燃焼はそれらにＸ点のダメージをあなたの望むように割り振って与える。\\nフラッシュバック―{R}{R}, カードＸ枚を捨てる。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456976&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30a334df-d42f-400c-97cc-84dae523cd07', 'multiverseId': 456976}, 'multiverseid': 456976}]", "[{'name': '狂気の預言者', 'text': '速攻\\n{T}, カード１枚を捨てる：カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': '「わしは見た。終わりも、始まりも、終わりの始まりも。死ではない。違うのだ。あれは超越だ！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456987&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dfb1d74-0a3e-4160-b7d5-e7082b84ca3d', 'multiverseId': 456987}, 'multiverseid': 456987}]", "[{'name': '猪の陰影', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「この中からだと、全部が晩飯に見えるな。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457008&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04653bc1-b2ea-42c0-980c-0cbcf4b8225b', 'multiverseId': 457008}, 'multiverseid': 457008}]", "[{'name': '献身のドルイド', 'text': '{T}：{G}を加える。\\n献身のドルイドの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く：献身のドルイドをアンタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': '「マナはすべての物の中に潜んでいます。人の心の奥深くにも。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457012&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dd85d1c-534a-4f52-adab-d52cb381589f', 'multiverseId': 457012}, 'multiverseid': 457012}]", "[{'name': '獣相のシャーマン', 'text': '{G}, {T}, クリーチャー・カード１枚を捨てる：あなたのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン', 'flavor': '彼女が身に着けているのは、呼び起こすことのできるあらゆる生命の護符だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457014&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b47464b9-3904-46df-8c1d-ecde4100e5f0', 'multiverseId': 457014}, 'multiverseid': 457014}]", "[{'name': '玉虫色のドレイク', 'text': '飛行\\n玉虫色のドレイクが戦場に出たとき、墓地からオーラ・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのコントロール下で玉虫色のドレイクにつけられた状態で戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドレイク', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456909&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f86ed724-2cec-463d-8ebd-cb1329f878a5', 'multiverseId': 456909}, 'multiverseid': 456909}]", "[{'name': '生き埋め', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード最大３枚を探してあなたの墓地に置き、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'シャベルの音と冷たい土の崩れる音で、彼らの哀願の声はすぐにかき消されてしまった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456938&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed8309a0-4985-4756-9c29-ccf108718c77', 'multiverseId': 456938}, 'multiverseid': 456938}]", "[{'name': '生き返りの蒸気', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚公開し、そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加える。あなたはそのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを得る。これにより公開された他のカードをすべてあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457055&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a488cf5-d91f-453e-97fb-b946a73016a4', 'multiverseId': 457055}, 'multiverseid': 457055}]", "[{'name': '生ける伝承', 'text': '生ける伝承が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を追放する。\\n生ける伝承のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、その追放したカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい。\\n生ける伝承が戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはこれを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたはその追放したカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — アバター', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456912&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '378f8163-7fd7-4e99-a824-139668672c4f', 'multiverseId': 456912}, 'multiverseid': 456912}]", "[{'name': '略奪の爆撃', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてパワーが２以下のクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、略奪の爆撃はそのクリーチャーが攻撃しているプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': 'ゴブリンの火の襲撃の第一波は、いつでも他の全員の狙いを嘆いている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456992&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f4f9b0a-d669-4f70-bee1-33eea3d3d419', 'multiverseId': 456992}, 'multiverseid': 456992}]", "[{'name': '療養所の骸骨', 'text': '{2}{B}：あなたの墓地から療養所の骸骨をあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スケルトン', 'flavor': '肉体より先に精神が滅びた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456961&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66eb6018-076b-4694-9da5-9cd11e5f4036', 'multiverseId': 456961}, 'multiverseid': 456961}]", "[{'name': '癇しゃく', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。癇しゃくはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\nマッドネス{R}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「炎よ、罪なき者は燃やすな。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456979&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c8ae851-86dd-41b3-b021-ff938042f153', 'multiverseId': 456979}, 'multiverseid': 456979}]", "[{'name': '発生器の召使い', 'text': '{T}, 発生器の召使いを生け贄に捧げる：{C}{C}を加える。このマナがクリーチャー・呪文のために使用されたなら、ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '有限の形を成した無限の可能性。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456983&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4ad9b92-93df-4c69-bd59-4fac1af95210', 'multiverseId': 456983}, 'multiverseid': 456983}]", "[{'name': '白金の帝像', 'text': 'あなたのライフ総量は変化できない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': 'それは時間や散逸性や死などのつまらない力を無視している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457083&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c3c5248-db43-428b-b5a3-52de82159d6b', 'multiverseId': 457083}, 'multiverseid': 457083}]", "[{'name': '目覚ましヒバリ', 'text': '飛行\\n目覚ましヒバリが戦場を離れたとき、あなたの墓地からパワーが２以下のクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。\\n想起{5}{W}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456881&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59744a30-8d0d-4703-bd12-8c79e3761afd', 'multiverseId': 456881}, 'multiverseid': 456881}]", "[{'name': '真似るスライム', 'text': '緑のＸ/Ｘのウーズ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「シミック連合にはこの能力の対価としてかなりの額を支払ったけれど、人件費の削減分ですぐに元が取れるでしょう。」\\n――オルゾフの僧院長、ミラーナ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457023&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b5b4f62-b8b1-4cf4-9ca4-3ecfc97c1f02', 'multiverseId': 457023}, 'multiverseid': 457023}]", "[{'name': '真実の解体者、コジレック', 'text': 'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、カードを４枚引く。\\n滅殺４（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはパーマネント４つを生け贄に捧げる。）\\n真実の解体者、コジレックがいずれかの領域から墓地に置かれたとき、これのオーナーは自分の墓地を自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルドラージ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456856&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caa29fe5-bb11-4284-b1be-9c58b50201dd', 'multiverseId': 456856}, 'multiverseid': 456856}]", "[{'name': '真鍮の災い魔', 'text': '速攻', 'type': 'クリーチャー — グレムリン', 'flavor': '飽くことない飢えに駆られるグレムリンは決して食べることをやめない。生涯をかけた作品が数分で駄目になることもある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456975&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ba8dae2-8c4d-4f24-b19e-e031273a7884', 'multiverseId': 456975}, 'multiverseid': 456975}]", "[{'name': '瞬唱の魔道士', 'text': '瞬速\\n瞬唱の魔道士が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはフラッシュバックを得る。そのフラッシュバック・コストは、それのマナ・コストに等しい。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、そのカードをそれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456921&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35af7ad2-21a8-4e1f-875f-48fe78040607', 'multiverseId': 456921}, 'multiverseid': 456921}]", "[{'name': '砂の殉教者', 'text': '{1}, あなたの手札から白のカードをＸ枚公開する, 砂の殉教者を生け贄に捧げる：あなたはＸの３倍の点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': '「我らの脆さの中にのみ真の力があります。そして、その力こそが生命そのものなのです。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456875&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '482e79da-b26a-47f8-bd64-16405ec8a4cb', 'multiverseId': 456875}, 'multiverseid': 456875}]", "[{'name': '研究室の偏執狂', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーにカードがないときにあなたがカードを引くなら、代わりにあなたはこのゲームに勝利する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '彼の頭には大いなる計画だけが渦巻き、それが成功したらどうなるかまでは考えが行かなかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456911&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7034fff6-7969-47ac-a0ca-ae3a251acb67', 'multiverseId': 456911}, 'multiverseid': 456911}]", "[{'name': '祖神に選ばれし者', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n祖神に選ばれし者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたの墓地にあるカード１枚につき１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': '「すべての意思を、この手で成そう。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456859&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '360df415-6736-4b71-b6df-0a64548487d1', 'multiverseId': 456859}, 'multiverseid': 456859}]", "[{'name': '神々の思し召し', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。色１色を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、それはプロテクション（その選ばれた色）を得る。占術１を行う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'テーロスの神々を敬え、さすれば相応の見返りを与えられん。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456868&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '941d8473-25e5-4420-ad47-0f8ed77bb1a3', 'multiverseId': 456868}, 'multiverseid': 456868}]", "[{'name': '神秘の回復', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456916&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13c4bd3d-5208-45be-8cd1-6fcf6cc6bbc2', 'multiverseId': 456916}, 'multiverseid': 456916}]", "[{'name': '神聖を汚す者のうめき', 'text': '黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{B}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'グールにとって、すべての村は御馳走であり、すべての災害は再会である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456957&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56b390cb-0c08-405e-858d-91382aae9d5e', 'multiverseId': 456957}, 'multiverseid': 456957}]", "[{'name': '禁忌の錬金術', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456906&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3156801a-4b42-4b81-88f2-2a9dde42cbd1', 'multiverseId': 456906}, 'multiverseid': 456906}]", "[{'name': '空召喚士ターランド', 'text': 'あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「海は広大だが、空はそれ以上に広大だ。その両方を統べることができるなら、なぜ１つの王国に満足しようか？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456926&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '859bb25d-dc27-4a8c-b0bf-0c40459e65aa', 'multiverseId': 456926}, 'multiverseid': 456926}]", "[{'name': '空想の飛行', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n空想の飛行が戦場に出たとき、カードを２枚引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '上空からの視界というものは、新たに翼を得た者にとっては霊感となる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456904&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b360912d-7d0f-4870-bdf1-ffe9ad531ffb', 'multiverseId': 456904}, 'multiverseid': 456904}]", "[{'name': '空槍の騎兵', 'text': '飛行、二段攻撃', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '彼女の槍が先に到達するように祈ることだ。彼女のグリフィンはそこまで優しくはないからな。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456886&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50143629-cdd4-44b5-96ab-f5cbad82431d', 'multiverseId': 456886}, 'multiverseid': 456886}]", "[{'name': '空翼のエイヴン', 'text': '飛行\\nカード１枚を捨てる：空翼のエイヴンをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士', 'flavor': '「私は私を運んでくれる風に似ている。厳しいけれど穏やか。通り過ぎるけれど常に存る。風と私は相連れだって、想像力を超えたかなたまで飛んでいく。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456919&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba580148-6aa9-45a2-9c7c-758bea0d887e', 'multiverseId': 456919}, 'multiverseid': 456919}]", "[{'name': '突撃の地鳴り', 'text': '土地・カード１枚を捨てる：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。突撃の地鳴りはそれに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '「生き残りをかけた戦争の間に、ドミナリアそのものが武器になったわ。敵は去ったけれど、危険は残っているのよ。」\\n――ジョイラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456996&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '714f82b2-a6c5-42ae-8409-490b939c0582', 'multiverseId': 456996}, 'multiverseid': 456996}]", "[{'name': '精霊の石塚', 'text': 'プレイヤーがカードを１枚捨てるたび、あなたは{W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '絶美な魂は死の際までも輝かしい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456887&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '548a973a-50f1-40ea-811f-891bc6192138', 'multiverseId': 456887}, 'multiverseid': 456887}]", "[{'name': '納墓', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探してあなたの墓地に置く。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「お前が完熟した頃また来るわね。」\\n――グール呼びのギサ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456944&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8369ebf7-8e4d-4a82-9763-b87a6a28301b', 'multiverseId': 456944}, 'multiverseid': 456944}]", "[{'name': '終わりなき休息の器', 'text': '終わりなき休息の器が戦場に出たとき、墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457085&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ce79782-23bf-4770-8adb-92c0d9cce0fe', 'multiverseId': 457085}, 'multiverseid': 457085}]", "[{'name': '絶望の天使', 'text': '飛行\\n絶望の天使が戦場に出たとき、パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '「彼らには義務と誓約の思いを感じるが、それ以外はまったく感じぬ。まるで虚空に対する義務を貫いているようだ。」\\n――ボロスの大天使、ラジア', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457046&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3654e66b-9a78-4c36-bde9-41e9d86d11f7', 'multiverseId': 457046}, 'multiverseid': 457046}]", "[{'name': '絶滅の王', 'text': '絶滅の王のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれすべての墓地にあるカードの総数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '死者の絶望的な声が融合し、その笑い声となる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457053&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92459476-e280-4158-9c1a-f12c21343322', 'multiverseId': 457053}, 'multiverseid': 457053}]", "[{'name': '縫い合わせのドレイク', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードを１枚追放する。\\n飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ドレイク', 'flavor': '「最高のスカーブは、その部品全部を集めたよりも強力で美しい。」\\n――縫い師、ゲラルフ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456922&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f10446d0-9269-43fb-9f55-11e2520d6473', 'multiverseId': 456922}, 'multiverseid': 456922}]", "[{'name': '縫い師の見習い', 'text': '{1}{U}, {T}：青の２/２のホムンクルス・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成し、その後クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ホムンクルス', 'flavor': '「オグロール、生命作る。オグロール、それ奪う。オグロール、神！……主人戻るまで。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456923&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad30dbcb-3359-47c2-a679-b7a15b48c063', 'multiverseId': 456923}, 'multiverseid': 456923}]", "[{'name': '繁殖力', 'text': 'クリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '命は永遠だ。個々の寿命は短いが。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457015&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f403b26-0be6-4d00-8dc7-de58f4dcbfe1', 'multiverseId': 457015}, 'multiverseid': 457015}]", "[{'name': '罪の自覚', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋３の修整を受ける。\\n{W}：罪の自覚をオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「何も信じないなんて、なんて臆病なの。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456862&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11d4a312-9943-456c-bf48-e76592df9883', 'multiverseId': 456862}, 'multiverseid': 456862}]", "[{'name': '羽毛覆い', 'text': '瞬速\\n防衛、飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '「そいつは空にそびえる巨大な翼みたいで、同じぐらいに静かだった。そいつは突然やってきたかと思ったら、キスキンの砦の視界を遮りやがったんだ。」\\n――メロウの殺し屋、グレンシュ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457068&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8afdc7c-103b-439b-ae81-632709eeb3ed', 'multiverseId': 457068}, 'multiverseid': 457068}]", "[{'name': '脳食願望', 'text': '対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から点数で見たマナ・コストが４以上のカード１枚を選び、そのカードを追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '桃と同じで、一口目が一番美味い。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456933&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '065b1be6-7ca5-46e6-a17e-f5667f196903', 'multiverseId': 456933}, 'multiverseid': 456933}]", "[{'name': '腐れる嫌悪者', 'text': '腐れる嫌悪者が戦場に出るに際し、対戦相手１人を選ぶ。腐れる嫌悪者は、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・ホラー', 'flavor': '忌まわしい病が根付いてしまうと、それは表皮と精神に広がっていく。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457062&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31e6edaa-1b4b-43e6-a7a6-40e35c1d6ee8', 'multiverseId': 457062}, 'multiverseid': 457062}]", "[{'name': '苛立たしい小悪魔', 'text': '苛立たしい小悪魔が戦場に出たとき、どの対戦相手も「これは自分に４点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。いずれかのプレイヤーがそうしたなら、苛立たしい小悪魔を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': '誰かが痛い目に遭うまでは面白くもない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457004&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c2c4226-d372-48c0-9f97-9c2987571b7b', 'multiverseId': 457004}, 'multiverseid': 457004}]", "[{'name': '若き紅蓮術士', 'text': 'あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、赤の１/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': '焼身は最も誠実な追従である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457005&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd51333a2-cf36-4dee-b8c6-ba61eb58cc11', 'multiverseId': 457005}, 'multiverseid': 457005}]", "[{'name': '苦花', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは１点のライフを失い、飛行を持つ黒の１/１のフェアリー・ならず者・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': '部族・エンチャント — フェアリー', 'flavor': 'ローウィンの短い夕刻の間、ある種のスミレが悪戯な香りを漂わせる花を咲かすのに十分な時間、太陽は地平線上に留まる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456935&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7a905c5-a0cd-4849-bda9-197719f8f241', 'multiverseId': 456935}, 'multiverseid': 456935}]", "[{'name': '荘厳な大天使', 'text': '飛行\\n賛美（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーは賛美を持つ。（同一のクリーチャーに賛美が複数あるなら、それぞれ誘発する。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456888&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd292da06-73e7-4a79-851c-bf148ed7e9b4', 'multiverseId': 456888}, 'multiverseid': 456888}]", "[{'name': '蓮眼の神秘家', 'text': '果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\n蓮眼の神秘家が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': 'すべての行動には、予見された目的がある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456873&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d4a9d0b-715c-43ab-9a21-90d84f4d11ac', 'multiverseId': 456873}, 'multiverseid': 456873}]", "[{'name': '蘇生', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「この新たなる生は天使からの贈り物ではなく、目的のために再び戦えという命令である。」\\n――セラの戦いの祝福', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456880&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0a76b5b-b620-426b-a862-3cd2e8839748', 'multiverseId': 456880}, 'multiverseid': 456880}]", "[{'name': '蘇生の天使', 'text': 'クリーチャーが１体戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは蘇生の天使を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、そのカードを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '天使は定命の者を暗澹とした気持ちで見守っている。最後に訪れる運命を知っているからだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456860&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38605ece-9c4a-4f1e-bb41-419eb7bbba45', 'multiverseId': 456860}, 'multiverseid': 456860}]", "[{'name': '虹色のレンズ', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '有能な魔道士ならば、焦点を調整した上で個々の円盤で次々とマナを屈折させ、望む呪文を唱えることができる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457084&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8523fa6-d9d1-4c3d-a1ae-392bbfec0201', 'multiverseId': 457084}, 'multiverseid': 457084}]", "[{'name': '蛇の陰影', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、「このクリーチャーが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。」を持つ。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457032&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ff737a4-f7cb-474f-969a-6d04bdaaa3c3', 'multiverseId': 457032}, 'multiverseid': 457032}]", "[{'name': '蜘蛛の発生', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき、到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457033&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a64ba4e1-56a3-489b-9b07-f87f5a75253b', 'multiverseId': 457033}, 'multiverseid': 457033}]", "[{'name': '蜘蛛の陰影', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、到達を持つ。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457034&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '764ff0db-ae7e-43de-a7d3-29742fe3172e', 'multiverseId': 457034}, 'multiverseid': 457034}]", "[{'name': '血の炎、ガルナ', 'text': '瞬速\\n血の炎、ガルナが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありこのターンにいずれかの領域からあなたの墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カードをすべてあなたの手札に戻す。\\nあなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457050&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '123962ae-15f9-4fab-adce-38a570b8d48d', 'multiverseId': 457050}, 'multiverseid': 457050}]", "[{'name': '裂け目の突破', 'text': 'あなたは、あなたの手札からクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。そのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\\n連繋（秘儀）{2}{R}{R}（あなたが秘儀・呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはあなたの手札からこのカードを公開して、連繋コストを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、このカードの効果をその呪文に加える。）', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457002&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b2737eb-dabf-465e-9dda-0e9aa5c1ff0c', 'multiverseId': 457002}, 'multiverseid': 457002}]", "[{'name': '解放された者、カーン', 'text': '+4：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札からカード１枚を追放する。\\n-3：パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\\n-14：解放された者、カーンにより追放された、オーラでないパーマネント・カードをすべて追放したまま、ゲームを再び開始する。その後、それらのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — カーン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456855&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7fc84f9-d722-4906-8ccf-7282341c3adf', 'multiverseId': 456855}, 'multiverseid': 456855}]", "[{'name': '解放の天使', 'text': '飛行\\n解放の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '「あなたは最善を尽くしました。もうお休みになって結構です。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456865&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c3d82fb-fa50-4fc5-8810-3ea575a26748', 'multiverseId': 456865}, 'multiverseid': 456865}]", "[{'name': '豪腕', 'text': 'トランプル\\n豪腕があなたの墓地にあり、あなたが森をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — インカーネーション', 'flavor': '「『我来たりぬ。』豪腕の怒鳴り声に、次元は震えた。」\\n――始まりの書', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457010&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a58a154-90e3-4090-a630-9c4b1b3ee575', 'multiverseId': 457010}, 'multiverseid': 457010}]", "[{'name': '貧民街の刈り取るもの', 'text': '貧民街の刈り取るものが戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ホラー', 'flavor': 'オルゾフはそれをギルドの支配が及ばない地域に差し向け、嘆く者のいない魂を回収している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456964&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34767d10-e24e-4280-9957-a30d134644bf', 'multiverseId': 456964}, 'multiverseid': 456964}]", "[{'name': '貴族の教主', 'text': '賛美（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\n{T}：{G}か{W}か{U}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド', 'flavor': '彼女は聖なる木立を、疫病や旱魃や下層の人々から守っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457024&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97815787-3c17-4629-899f-566a72f97e16', 'multiverseId': 457024}, 'multiverseid': 457024}]", "[{'name': '轟く激震', 'text': '轟く激震は飛行を持たない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{R}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '悪魔がお前の玄関までの道を開いたら、引っ越すべき時だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456995&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c92a682d-3b4e-4e7e-aeb5-4aa39f91c29a', 'multiverseId': 456995}, 'multiverseid': 456995}]", "[{'name': '農民の結集', 'text': 'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「夜中に出歩かねばならぬなら、烏合の衆を連れて行け。」\\n――エルゴードの聖戦士の師', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456878&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9356d366-60ab-49be-b797-df124ddaebb4', 'multiverseId': 456878}, 'multiverseid': 456878}]", "[{'name': '迅速な報い', 'text': '魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタントやソーサリーであるカードが２枚以上あるなら、あなたは迅速な報いを、瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\\nタップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456889&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2ad52aa-43f2-487e-ac84-6531bed0cf2b', 'multiverseId': 456889}, 'multiverseid': 456889}]", "[{'name': '遮蔽する粘体', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n遮蔽する粘体が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457072&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0a441a6-dfaf-48d2-9982-3befe247e70a', 'multiverseId': 457072}, 'multiverseid': 457072}]", "[{'name': '邪悪な囁き', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け速攻を得る。\\nマッドネス{3}{R}（あなたがこのカードを捨てるなら、これを追放領域に捨てる。そうしたとき、マッドネス・コストでこれを唱えるか、これをあなたの墓地に置く。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456989&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab87f1a1-1e2c-4ba8-b65e-4192bc6b583d', 'multiverseId': 456989}, 'multiverseid': 456989}]", "[{'name': '都の進化', 'text': 'カードを３枚引く。このターン、あなたは追加の土地を１つプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'シミック連合が混成体の実験個体を解き放つにつれ、より多くの生息地が必要とされるようになった。そしてこれには常に、地元民の代償が伴った。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457058&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '631c8bc2-1dd3-4d95-a891-27ba9383f680', 'multiverseId': 457058}, 'multiverseid': 457058}]", "[{'name': '野生の雑種犬', 'text': 'カード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、野生の雑種犬は＋１/＋１の修整を受け、あなたが選んだ色１色になる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猟犬', 'flavor': '犬に死んだふりの芸を教えるのが普通だが、こいつの場合教えるのは犬のほうなんだからね。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457044&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e35a09e-0cad-425a-a3ce-cd75738ea538', 'multiverseId': 457044}, 'multiverseid': 457044}]", "[{'name': '野生の飢え', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '狩人のオットーは様々な野望で満ちていた。蛇の腹はオットーで満ちていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457043&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64e23499-0abd-4a34-b9e1-05559c29d860', 'multiverseId': 457043}, 'multiverseid': 457043}]", "[{'name': '鋳塊かじり', 'text': '鋳塊かじりが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n想起{R}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '精霊は形を成した思考だ。例えばこいつは「ぶち壊しがい」という考えだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456985&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e74bee4e-5641-4393-8fb6-2ae9038f2ff7', 'multiverseId': 456985}, 'multiverseid': 456985}]", "[{'name': '錯乱した助手', 'text': '{T}, あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードをあなたの墓地に置く：{C}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「ガルー、懸濁液の容器を調整してくれ。ガルー、もっと多くの死体を取ってこい。ガルー、泣くのは止めてお前の脳組織をよこせ。こんな横暴を止めないなら、辞めますからね。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456899&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d757cd4-e88c-4a97-8708-cc036c258eed', 'multiverseId': 456899}, 'multiverseid': 456899}]", "[{'name': '長魚の陰影', 'text': '瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントされているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているダメージをすべて取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456903&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23ad1d21-a416-4e9b-b262-0c8f8be27d21', 'multiverseId': 456903}, 'multiverseid': 456903}]", "[{'name': '闇の試み', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを再生する。カードを１枚引く。\\n魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタントやソーサリーであるカードが２枚以上あるなら、あなたがコントロールしている他の各クリーチャーもそれぞれ再生する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456941&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70b029cd-c1d0-4b11-8750-859d0dfd1be0', 'multiverseId': 456941}, 'multiverseid': 456941}]", "[{'name': '闇の追い返し', 'text': 'クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらをタップする。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '闇に盲いる者に恩恵を。闇に住まう者に厳刑を。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456879&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '040ada06-a5bf-410a-b79f-1d7bde8188b2', 'multiverseId': 456879}, 'multiverseid': 456879}]", "[{'name': '闇告げカラス', 'text': '飛行\\n闇告げカラスが戦場に出るか死亡したとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・鳥', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456940&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bf679c2-de52-4f21-a5ba-c83f46c708e5', 'multiverseId': 456940}, 'multiverseid': 456940}]", "[{'name': '闘技場の競技者', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたが闘技場の競技者を対象とする呪文を唱えるたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間', 'flavor': 'イロアスの競技会ではメダルは授与されない。競技者達は勝利の神イロアスからの御光臨を賜ることを目指し競うのである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456973&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b5e75d9-c671-47c8-ab3a-01c1fce0e2fe', 'multiverseId': 456973}, 'multiverseid': 456973}]", "[{'name': '陰極器', 'text': '陰極器が死亡したとき、{C}{C}{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '熱で駄目になるような道具を作る代わりに、スランは熱で充電するような道具を作った。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457076&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5676e6fe-a0ad-448b-965d-5b558f1ad4ed', 'multiverseId': 457076}, 'multiverseid': 457076}]", "[{'name': '霊気撃ち', 'text': '霊気撃ちが戦場に出たとき、土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n想起{1}{U}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456894&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3bfdc07-9954-4b2f-b45a-4ef1da966c9b', 'multiverseId': 456894}, 'multiverseid': 456894}]", "[{'name': '霧への変化', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「あたしがよけると思ったのかい？変わってるねぇ。」\\n――ミストメドウの魔女、オルカ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457074&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd1040c7-0a02-4a6e-ab9e-9f1c5d562911', 'multiverseId': 457074}, 'multiverseid': 457074}]", "[{'name': '霧覆いの平地', 'text': '（{T}：{W}を加える。）\\n霧覆いの平地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{W}, {T}：あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。この能力は、あなたが白のパーマネントを２つ以上コントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。', 'type': '土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457097&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfe517cb-e61e-4628-9b97-6102e6d8d172', 'multiverseId': 457097}, 'multiverseid': 457097}]", "[{'name': '風切るイグアナール', 'text': '他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。あなたは「風切るイグアナールはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トカゲ', 'flavor': 'けっこうカワイイ。遠くから見ているだけなら。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456984&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3b3c9de-a673-435f-b7e7-69f1b0a6103e', 'multiverseId': 456984}, 'multiverseid': 456984}]", "[{'name': '骨塚のワーム', 'text': '骨塚のワームのパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの総数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ワーム', 'flavor': 'そいつにとって、骨溜まりを見つけるより好ましいのは、そこに骨を足すことだけだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457009&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e485cbca-fbcb-46df-baf7-f29edb420ef1', 'multiverseId': 457009}, 'multiverseid': 457009}]", "[{'name': '魂の洞窟', 'text': '魂の洞窟が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナは、選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用でき、その呪文は打ち消されない。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457087&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95bcdd1b-a311-41cd-a399-3430820e888b', 'multiverseId': 457087}, 'multiverseid': 457087}]", "[{'name': '魂の火', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '憤怒と炎を象った化身。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456998&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab6cb133-a35a-49e8-a29f-70da17608516', 'multiverseId': 456998}, 'multiverseid': 456998}]", "[{'name': '魔力の櫃', 'text': '魔力の櫃は、あなたのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは{4}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、魔力の櫃をアンタップする。\\nあなたのドロー・ステップの開始時に、魔力の櫃がタップ状態である場合、これはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{T}：{C}{C}{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457079&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f57e6d92-3faa-4c65-bfe1-4956e76c0cc2', 'multiverseId': 457079}, 'multiverseid': 457079}]", "[{'name': '魔道士輪の魔力網', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：魔道士輪の魔力網の上に貯蔵カウンターを１個置く。\\n{T}, 魔道士輪の魔力網の上から貯蔵カウンターを望む数取り除く：これにより取り除いた貯蔵カウンター１個につき{C}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457096&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7cb4a29-904c-4f34-97eb-69990931465d', 'multiverseId': 457096}, 'multiverseid': 457096}]", "[{'name': '鷺群れのシガルダ', 'text': '飛行、呪禁\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力は、あなたにパーマネントを生け贄に捧げさせることができない。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '大いなる献身は大いなる報償をもたらす。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=457056&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '973590b0-a8d3-4cde-be5f-d3e64004e71b', 'multiverseId': 457056}, 'multiverseid': 457056}]", "[{'name': '黄泉からの橋', 'text': 'トークンでないクリーチャーが１体戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、黄泉からの橋があなたの墓地にある場合、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nクリーチャーが１体戦場から対戦相手の墓地に置かれたとき、黄泉からの橋があなたの墓地にある場合、黄泉からの橋を追放する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456937&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c6ec417-c2da-4b8f-a907-09a353954ea5', 'multiverseId': 456937}, 'multiverseid': 456937}]", "[{'name': '黄金牙、タシグル', 'text': '探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\n{2}{G/U}{G/U}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。その後、あなたの墓地から対戦相手１人が選んだ、土地でないカード１枚をあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456967&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c4b6a17-f68c-4b81-9827-74a6dc82d68a', 'multiverseId': 456967}, 'multiverseid': 456967}]", "[{'name': '黎明をもたらす者レイヤ', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '「私の許し無く死すことはありません。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=456882&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90d27264-c36f-4475-bd09-d180f0309b05', 'multiverseId': 456882}, 'multiverseid': 456882}]"]
